        <rdfs:label>Prefabricated Metal Building and Component Manufacturing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing prefabricated metal buildings, panels, and sections.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


