        <rdfs:label>Rail Transportation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in operating railroads (except street railroads, commuter rail, urban rapid transit, and scenic and sightseeing trains).  Line-haul railroads and short-line railroads are included in this industry.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/QfwBa1fGRFu9ySPfMd8khw -->

