        <rdfs:label>Used Household and Office Goods Moving</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in providing local or long-distance trucking of used household, used institutional, or used commercial furniture and equipment. Incidental packing and storage activities are often provided by these establishments.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


