        <rdfs:label>PA360 Validation Patent Application Preparation - Domestic</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>All actions associated with the preparation and filing of applications for validation of an issued regional patent in the (&apos;domestic&apos;) home country of the applicant. Note that PCT National Phase Entry is a continuing application process included under PA350 or PA550.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>PA360 Validation Patent Application Preparation - Domestic</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


