        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">美国陆军情报和安全司令部</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The United States Army Intelligence and Security Command (INSCOM) is a direct reporting unit that conducts intelligence, security, and information operations for U.S. Army commanders and national decision makers.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel>INSCOM</skos:hiddenLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel>U.S. Army Intelligence and Security Command</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


