        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">消费者信息和保险监管中心</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Center for Consumer Information and Insurance Oversight (CCIIO) is charged with helping implement many reforms of the Affordable Care Act, the historic health reform bill that was signed into law March 23, 2010. CCIIO oversees the implementation of the provisions related to private health insurance. In particular, CCIIO is working with states to establish new Health Insurance Marketplaces.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel>CCIIO</skos:hiddenLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel>Center for Consumer Information and Insurance Oversight</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


