        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">因缺乏诉讼资格而驳回动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">訴訟能力不足のための却下申立</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Dismiss for Lack of Standing is a legal request to dismiss a case because the plaintiff does not have the legal right to bring the claim.</skos:definition>
