        <rdfs:label>Negligent Infliction of Emotional Distress on a Direct Victim</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Fahrlässige Zufügung von emotionalem Leid an einem direkten Opfer</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Inflição negligente de angústia emocional em uma vítima direta</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Negligencia en la Causación de Angustia Emocional a una Víctima Directa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Negligencia en la Causación de Angustia Emocional a una Víctima Directa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Negligent Infliction of Emotional Distress on a Direct Victim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Négligence dans l&apos;infligement de détresse émotionnelle à une victime directe</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הטרדה רגשית של קורבן ישיר עקב הפרת חובת זהירות</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">एक सीधे पीड़ित पर भावनात्मक दुःख की अनापत्ति का अपराध</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">对直接受害者的过失造成情感伤害</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">直接被害者に対する過失による感情的苦痛の負担</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of &quot;Negligent Infliction of Emotional Distress on a Direct Victim&quot; refers to a legal claim where a person suffers emotional harm due to the negligent actions of another party, and the harm is inflicted directly on the victim rather than being a result of witnessing harm to someone else.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


