        <rdfs:label>Bequest</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Estate Gift</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Inheritance Gift</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Inherited Bequest</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Legacy</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Testamentary Gift</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Bequest is a provision in a will or trust that designates the transfer of specific assets, property, or money to a particular beneficiary upon the death of the testator. It ensures that the intended recipients receive the designated items as part of the estate distribution.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


