        <skos:definition>Use only for preparation activities in connection with patent applications that are to be filed outside the (&apos;domestic&apos;) home country or region of the applicant, and that can not be included under a previous code, or as instructed by the client.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>PA599 Other Patent Application Preparation - International</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


