        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעות נהגים עם ביטוח מוגבל</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">अपर्याप्त बीमाकृत मोटर यात्री दावे</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">保険金不足のモーターリストクレーム</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">未投保或保险不足的机动车驾驶员索赔</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A claim made by an insured individual against their own insurance policy when the at-fault driver in an accident does not have enough insurance coverage to fully compensate for the damages.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


