        <skos:definition>A &quot;Security Incident&quot; refers to an event or series of events that may compromise the confidentiality, integrity, or availability of an asset or data, either in a cyber environment or a physical space. Such incidents can range from minor infractions that are easily resolved to major breaches with significant consequences.</skos:definition>
