        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">犯罪的な被害</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Criminal Harm refers to the specific harm caused by a criminal act, which is an essential element of a criminal claim.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R4jNOMsOb90LEyZJyGMdIs -->

