        <skos:definition>The National Protection and Programs Directorate (NPPD) is a component within the United States Department of Homeland Security. NPPD&apos;s goal is to advance the Department&apos;s national security mission by reducing and eliminating threats to U.S. critical physical and cyber infrastructure.</skos:definition>
