        <skos:altLabel>TV Broadcast</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>TV Transmission</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Televised Broadcast</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Television Broadcast is the transmission of video content, along with audio, to a dispersed audience via television signals through terrestrial, cable, or satellite systems. Television broadcasts deliver a wide range of programming including news, entertainment, educational shows, and advertisements, reaching viewers in real-time or through scheduled programming.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


