        <skos:altLabel>Cultivated Plants</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Farm Crops</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Crops are cultivated plants grown on a large scale for food, fiber, fuel, or other commercial purposes. They play a crucial role in agriculture and the global economy, providing essential resources for human and animal consumption, industrial uses, and energy production.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


