        <rdfs:label>Early Warning Report</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>An Early Warning Report, also known as a Beneficial Ownership Report, is a document filed by significant shareholders or entities who acquire a considerable stake in a company. It alerts the market and regulators about changes in ownership that may affect control of the company.</skos:definition>
