        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">答复交叉诉讼</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Answer with Cross-Claims refers to a legal response to a complaint or claim made by a defendant against a co-defendant in a lawsuit, asserting that the co-defendant is responsible for all or part of the damages being claimed.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


