        <rdfs:label>Bias</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Bias refers to a preconceived opinion or inclination that affects an individual&apos;s ability to make fair, objective, and impartial judgments. In a legal context, bias can compromise the fairness of legal proceedings and may be grounds for disqualification of an Actor (e.g., juror, witness, prosecutor, judge).</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


