        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">重要事実の故意的な非開示に対する不動産ブローカーの購入者への責任</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Real Estate Broker&apos;s Liability to Purchaser for Intentional Nondisclosure of Material Facts: The legal responsibility of a real estate broker to a purchaser for intentionally withholding important information about a property that would have affected the purchaser&apos;s decision to buy, and the resulting legal claims that may be brought against the broker for such actions.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R76UTCrg8DDzlFkZCPjrdqe -->

