        <rdfs:label>Tomatoes</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Solanum Lycopersicum</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Tomatoes are fruit vegetables from the Solanum lycopersicum species, known for their juicy flesh, sweet-tart flavor, and versatility in culinary applications. Widely cultivated and consumed globally, tomatoes are valued for their high vitamin C and antioxidant content, including lycopene, which is linked to various health benefits.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


