        <skos:definition>A Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court in Crawford County is a specific court within the Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court system that handles minor criminal offenses, traffic violations, and civil cases involving amounts up to $12,000.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


