        <rdfs:label>Asexual</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>In the context of human sexuality, asexual refers to a lack of sexual attraction to others or low or absent interest in engaging in sexual activity. It is also an orientation that forms part of the LGBTQIA+ spectrum, although individual experiences and definitions can vary.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


