        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">买方同意要求</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Buyer Consent Requirement is a legal concept that refers to the obligation of a party to obtain the consent of the buyer before taking certain actions, subject to certain conditions and limitations, as specified in a negative covenant.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


