        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>L330 Depositions</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A deposition (L330) is a legal proceeding where a witness gives sworn testimony outside of court, typically in a lawyer&apos;s office, as part of the discovery (L300) process.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


