        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">陪審員の排除権</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Peremptory Challenge of Juror is the right of a party in a trial to reject a potential juror without stating a reason, as long as the rejection is not based on race or gender.</skos:definition>
