        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">审判证言事件</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">裁判所証言イベント</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Trial Testimony Event refers to the phase of a trial where witnesses are questioned and provide evidence under oath, including both direct-examination and cross-examination.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


