        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">カバルド語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">卡巴尔达语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Kabardian (Language) is a specific written or spoken structured system of communication that consists of grammar and vocabulary, belonging to the Language top-level class.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


