        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">申請人/原告</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">申请人/起诉人</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An applicant or petitioner is a person who files a petition or makes an application or the person who is applying for a legal remedy to a problem.</skos:definition>
