        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">对宠物受伤的责任</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Liability for Injury to Pets refers to the legal responsibility for harm caused to a domesticated animal, such as a dog or cat, and the resulting damages that may be awarded to the pet owner.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


