        <rdfs:label>Wildlife Trafficking</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Illegal Wildlife Trade</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Illicit Wildlife Commerce</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Unauthorized Wildlife Trafficking</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Wildlife Trafficking is the illegal trade, smuggling, or movement of wildlife and wildlife products across borders. This activity contributes to the decline of species and biodiversity, violating national and international laws.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Animal Smuggling</skos:prefLabel>
