        <rdfs:label>Millet</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Millet is a group of small-seeded cereal crops belonging to the Poaceae family, known for their resilience to harsh growing conditions and nutritional benefits. These grains are staple foods in many parts of Asia and Africa, providing essential nutrients such as carbohydrates, proteins, and minerals.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


