        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">विवाद में राशि - &quot;से अधिक&quot; के रूप में व्यक्त की गई</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">争議金額 - 「超過」と表現される</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">争议金额 - 表示为“超过”</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The minimum amount in controversy, where the actual amount in dispute exceeds that minimum. Example: U.S. federal courts deciding a state-law matter (e.g., breach of contract) require an amount of controversy exceeding a certain amount (in 2022, that amount was $75,000).</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7Wr4hG8vwC8fkSaCK9ZhOz -->

