        <rdfs:label>Lemons</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Citrus Limon</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Lemons are small, yellow citrus fruits from the Citrus limon species, known for their tart, acidic juice and aromatic zest. They are widely used in culinary applications, beverages, and as a natural cleaning agent, valued for their high vitamin C content and refreshing flavor.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


