        <rdfs:label>Indiana Circuit Court - Henry County 2</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A court of general jurisdiction in Henry County, Indiana, with the authority to hear and decide a wide range of legal cases within its geographical jurisdiction.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7fqic2eihU8WdOySp5QfW0 -->

