        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">persan</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">ペルシャ語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">波斯语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Persian (Language) is a structured system of communication that consists of grammar and vocabulary, and is a member of the Language class, used in legal matters.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


