        <rdfs:label>Flax</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Linen Plant</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Linseed Plant</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Flax is a fiber crop cultivated for its strong and durable fibers, used primarily to produce linen fabric. In addition to its textile applications, flax seeds are used to extract oil, known as linseed oil, which is utilized in various industrial and culinary applications.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


