        <skos:definition>The dating market refers to a division of the market that is specifically targeted towards individuals who are seeking romantic relationships. This segment encompasses products and services that facilitate the process of finding and connecting with potential partners, such as dating apps, matchmaking services, and social events.</skos:definition>
