        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">一時的差止命令の解除申立て</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">解除临时禁令动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Dissolve Temporary Restraining Order is a formal request made to the court to lift a temporary order that prohibits a party from taking certain actions until a hearing can be held to determine whether a permanent order should be issued.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7hfniIZMUH3UTYCynbKG0P -->

