        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">计算机失误</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Computer Malpractice refers to a type of malpractice claim that arises from the failure of a professional to use reasonable care in the use of computer technology, resulting in harm to a client or patient.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


