            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Civil Legal Determination</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A &quot;civil legal determination&quot; refers to the decision or verdict made by a court in a civil case. It includes outcomes such as finding a party liable or not liable for a particular claim or issue. This determination often leads to remedies or judgments, such as monetary awards or injunctive relief, to resolve the dispute between the parties involved in the civil litigation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7kodSBxHt8yXxA0EKNJobL -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7kodSBxHt8yXxA0EKNJobL">
