        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">消费者合同索赔</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Consumer Contract Claims are legal claims made by a party in a contract with a consumer, including claims related to billing errors, unlawful provisions, unconscionable circumstances, and improper actions by loan brokers.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7n9rAWIq1fi7qGb3xRynWG -->

