        <rdfs:label>Motion to File Supplemental Briefing for Petition for Rehearing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Antrag auf Einreichung einer ergänzenden Stellungnahme für die Petition zur Wiederholung der Anhörung</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Moción para presentar informe complementario para petición de reconsideración</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Motion pour déposer un mémoire supplémentaire pour la pétition de réexamen</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Motion to File Supplemental Briefing for Petition for Rehearing</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Petição para apresentação de alegações complementares para o pedido de reconsideração</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Solicitud de presentación de informe complementario para petición de reconsideración</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תנועה להגשת מסמך משלים לבקשה לדיון מחדש</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">पुनरावृत्ति के लिए अतिरिक्त ब्रीफिंग फ़ाइल करने के लिए मोशन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">再審請求のための補足意見書の提出を求める動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">提交补充陈述的动议，申请重审</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to File Supplemental Briefing for Petition for Rehearing is a formal request to submit additional written arguments or evidence to support a request for a new hearing, after a decision has already been made, in order to address new or relevant information that was not available at the time of the original hearing.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7nYjWxGQdHVUZcYq7nUpSZ -->

