        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">赞助协议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Sponsorship Agreement is a legally binding contract between two parties that outlines the terms and conditions of a sponsorship arrangement, typically involving the exchange of goods, services, or financial support in exchange for advertising or promotional opportunities.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


