        <skos:definition>A strategic buyer is a type of M&amp;A buyer who acquires a company with the intention of achieving long-term goals, such as expanding their market share or diversifying their product offerings.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7oop8Do8ZoVb99BBKZBPMk -->

