        <rdfs:label>inv_total_tax_other_iso</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>&quot;For mixed currency situations only where it is mandated that the total tax must also be reported in a different currency ISO.  The sum of all MATTER.matter_tax_on_fees + MATTER.matter_tax_on_exp + the sum of all TAX_TIER_SUMMARY.tax_tier_total_amount for this inv_id in the ISO required by law as identified in INVOICE.inv_other_iso. 

This figure includes Withholding Taxes and Tiered Taxes applicable to this invoice.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


