        <skos:definition>Action (Immigration-related) that do not involve Naturalization Applications or petitions for Writ of Habeas Corpus, such as complaints alleging failure to adjudicate an application to adjust immigration status to permanent resident.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7qOIe1R5RuWJy0aoak47sg -->

