        <rdfs:seeAlso>A Construction Agreement is a binding contract between a property owner and a contractor, outlining the terms for construction work on a property. It details the scope of work, payment schedules, responsibilities, and other provisions related to the construction project.</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7qrXXQ5A5fENvEmT0MRkcQ -->

