        <rdfs:label>Individual Person Characteristics</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Individual person characteristics refer to the distinct attributes or qualities that define a person&apos;s identity and differentiate them from others. These characteristics can include things like age, gender, race, ethnicity, national origin, and disability.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7sKCtSzamzXRER0AW4YGDS -->

