        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">一般赔偿条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A General Indemnity Clause is a provision in a contract where one party agrees to protect and compensate the other party for any losses, damages, or liabilities that may arise from the contract, regardless of fault or cause.</skos:definition>
