        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">善意谈判条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Good Faith Negotiation Clause is a provision in a contract that requires the parties to negotiate in good faith when attempting to resolve disputes or reach an agreement.</skos:definition>
