        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">優れたオファー-最小必要資産額</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A &quot;Superior Offer - Minimum Necessary Amount of Assets&quot; is a specific threshold within the broader concept of &quot;Superior Offer&quot; that requires a minimum amount of assets to be included in an offer in order for it to be considered superior to other offers in a legal matter.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


