        <rdfs:label>European Council</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Council of the European Union Heads of State</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The European Council is a key institution of the European Union that comprises the heads of state or government of the member states, the President of the European Council, and the President of the European Commission. It plays a crucial role in setting the EU&apos;s overall political direction and priorities, but does not have legislative power.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>EU Summit</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


