        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">控訴最終形式ブリーフ</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A written legal argument submitted to an appellate court as a final attempt to persuade the court to rule in favor of the submitting party, following the submission of previous briefs and oral arguments.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7yrQjhxTeSoEQWSBUhSusG -->

