        <skos:altLabel>Renal and Reproductive Disorders</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Urogenital Disorders</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Genitourinary disorders encompass a range of conditions affecting the organs of the reproductive and urinary systems, including the kidneys, bladder, ureters, urethra, and reproductive organs. These disorders can be congenital or acquired and may involve functional impairment, structural abnormalities, or systemic diseases impacting the genitourinary system.</skos:definition>
