        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">非統合書簡</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An opinion letter stating that a property will not be subject to “substantive consolidation” in situations where a restructuring or liquidation may involve the property’s owner.</skos:definition>
