        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Aplicação de Forward-Looking MAE - Linguagem &quot;Impacto adverso nos negócios do alvo&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Application de Forward-Looking MAE - Langage &quot;Impact négatif sur l&apos;activité de la cible&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">Forward-Looking MAE アプリケーション - &quot;ターゲットのビジネスへの不利な影響&quot; 言語</skos:altLabel>
