        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">फॉरवर्ड-लुकिंग एमएई एप्लिकेशन - &quot;लक्ष्य के व्यवसाय पर नकारात्मक प्रभाव&quot; भाषा</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">前瞻性 MAE 应用 - &quot;对目标业务的不利影响&quot; 语言</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Forward-looking MAE Application - &quot;Adverse impact on target&apos;s business&quot; Language is a specific application of the Forward-looking Material Adverse Effect (MAE) Standard that focuses on the potential negative effects on the target company&apos;s business in the future.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


