            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>JE10 Issue and Serve Proceedings and Preparation of Statement of Case (UK J-CODE)</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Work related to effecting service, including dealing with process servers or the foreign process office. Work in preparation of claims, petitions and any other originating process, Statements of Case, Part 20 proceedings, including reviewing those of other parties whether or not a responsive document is served. Includes all work with counsel thereon and all dealings with client and others in connection therewith.  In appeals includes Appellants’ and Respondents’ Notices and supporting skeleton arguments.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7zeIIm4x0pd88nhZz9Jdnh -->

