        <skos:altLabel>Master of Fine Arts</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An M.F.A. (Master of Fine Arts) is an advanced degree typically earned in creative or performing arts disciplines, such as visual arts, writing, or theater. It signifies a high level of proficiency and specialization in artistic endeavors</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>M.F.A.</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7zeIvDfPCP2MF0Dv7IDdxw -->

