        <rdfs:label>Birds</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Birds are a class of vertebrate animals characterized by feathers, beaks without teeth, and a high metabolic rate. Most birds are capable of flight, although some species are flightless, and they lay hard-shelled eggs, exhibit complex behaviors, and are found in a variety of environments worldwide.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Avians</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


