        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">公務員による行為または不作為</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">公职人员的行为或不作为</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An act or failure to act by a government employee that results in harm or injury to another person, which may give rise to a legal claim for damages under the doctrine of governmental tort liability.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


