        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">連邦サービス行き詰まりパネル</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Federal Service Impasses Panel resolves impasses between federal agencies and unions representing federal employees arising from negotiations arising under the Federal Service Labor-Management Relations Statute and the Federal Employees Flexible and Compressed Work Schedules Act.</skos:definition>
