        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">原告的重罪行为</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Plaintiff&apos;s felonious conduct may prevent liability for damages based on negligence if plaintiff&apos;s injuries were in part caused by plaintiff&apos;s commission of a felony and plaintiff has been convicted of said felony.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


