        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">重新开放对抗程序动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Reopen Adversary Proceeding is a request made in a bankruptcy case to reopen a previously closed legal dispute between parties.</skos:definition>
