        <rdfs:label>A.S. (Associate of Science)</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Associate of Science</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An A.S. (Associate of Science) is a two-year degree commonly obtained from community colleges, focusing on science and mathematics courses. It serves as a starting point for further education or entry into science-related careers</skos:definition>
