        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">非法驱逐租户</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Unlawful Eviction of Tenant is the act of a landlord removing a tenant from their rental property without following the proper legal procedures, such as obtaining a court order or providing proper notice.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


