        <rdfs:label>API and API Management</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>API and API Management refers to the process of creating, publishing, and managing application programming interfaces (APIs) that allow different software applications to communicate with each other and share data.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


