        <skos:definition>Industries in this group include establishments that: operate facilities where patrons can primarily engage in sports, recreation, amusement, or gambling activities and/or; provide other amusement and recreation services, such as supplying and servicing amusement devices in places of business operated by others; operating sports teams, clubs, or leagues engaged in playing games for recreational purposes; and guiding tours without using transportation equipment.</skos:definition>
