        <skos:definition>Discounts and Credits refer to reductions in fees or expenses provided to clients as a result of various factors such as matter type, volume of work, or other negotiated terms, and can be applied to specific fees or expenses within an Engagement for providing legal services.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


