        <rdfs:label>Compensation Bonus</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A bonus is a supplemental payment given to employees in addition to their regular salary or wages, typically as a reward for exceptional performance, meeting certain targets, or achieving specific goals. Bonuses are intended to incentivize and recognize outstanding contributions to an organization.</skos:definition>
