        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">尽职调查附条件条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A due diligence contingency clause is a provision in a contract that allows a party to conduct an investigation or review of the subject matter before the contract becomes binding.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


