        <rdfs:label>Arkansas District Court - Crittenden Cty.</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Arkansas District Court - Crittenden Cty. is a specific court within the Arkansas District Court system that has jurisdiction over legal matters within Crittenden County, Arkansas.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Ju8YnNmildQLZAVQ6XcCc -->

