        <rdfs:label>Rhode Island Supreme Court</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Rhode Island Supreme Court is the highest court in the state of Rhode Island and is responsible for hearing appeals from lower state courts.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


