        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">確定判決の申立て</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Declaratory Judgment is a legal request made to a court to issue a formal declaration on the rights, duties, or obligations of parties involved in a legal dispute, without ordering any specific action or awarding damages.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


