        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">経費</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">费用</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Expenses refer to the various costs incurred during a legal matter, including but not limited to word processing, deposition transcripts, litigation support vendors, meals, copying, experts, trial exhibits, delivery services/messengers, witness fees, local counsel, postage, other professionals, online research, arbitrators/mediators, travel, trial transcripts, other, subpoena fees, outside printing, private investigators, facsimile, and court fees.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KRbvSFG2MLCQiR7x5ZvKl -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KRbvSFG2MLCQiR7x5ZvKl">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rt4T1FlyWPLKcpZDSAspuG"/>
        <rdfs:label>Comparative Fault of Plaintiff</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Comparative Fault of Plaintiff</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Culpa comparativa del demandante</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Culpa comparativa del demandante</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Culpa comparativa do autor</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Faute comparative du demandeur</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Vergleichbares Verschulden des Klägers</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">אשמת השוואה של התובע</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">प्रतिकूल दायित्व वाले प्रतिवादी की तुलनात्मक दोष</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">原告の比較過失</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">原告的比较过失</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of &quot;Comparative Fault of Plaintiff&quot; refers to the legal principle that allows a plaintiff&apos;s recovery to be reduced in proportion to their own degree of fault or negligence in causing their own injuries, as compared to the fault of the defendant.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KT9QykaxR1R8wBs03ssqu -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KT9QykaxR1R8wBs03ssqu">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8xekNn7K6SxToo5ArjIsTX"/>
        <rdfs:label>Motion to File Opposition</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Antrag auf Einreichung eines Widerspruchs</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Moción para presentar oposición</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Moción para presentar oposición</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Motion pour déposer une opposition</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Motion to File Opposition</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Petição para apresentar oposição</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעה להגשת התנגדות</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">विरोध दाखिल करने के लिए आवेदन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">提交反对动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">異議申立の提出</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to File Opposition is a formal request made to a court or administrative agency seeking permission to submit a written response opposing a previous motion or request filed by another party in a legal proceeding.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KVtqeb8Oo0tlksHlVNV9n -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KVtqeb8Oo0tlksHlVNV9n">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9UXMB7LO35e1n0zwV2MVmh"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCzs34uEQI9f4cuWp3bQO0P"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RZ1dOPJ6HH6lMJGSLNxfwV"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Novation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Novación</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Novación</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Novation</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Novation</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Novation</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Novação</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">נובציה</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">नोवेशन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">ノベーション</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">转让</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Novation refers to the substitution of a new contract or obligation for an existing one, with the mutual agreement of all parties involved, resulting in the discharge of the original obligation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KWSGMRNF0TtSGr3emUfqf -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KWSGMRNF0TtSGr3emUfqf">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7p3ZBGzc1BxDrCwYJnsTo"/>
        <rdfs:label>Repurchase Agreement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Repo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Often referred to as a &quot;repo,&quot; a Repurchase Agreement is a short-term borrowing mechanism where one party sells a security with an agreement to repurchase it at a later date at a specified price. It&apos;s effectively a secured loan.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Kct0jHjiuhDNpRBnEndX3 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Kct0jHjiuhDNpRBnEndX3">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8r0fE60KG2VwRq1OwbjEUY"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9G5Ptc8g9T3Ag0GDVQOwae"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RB8rNcS7dCmm3zkSaztNUz6"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Motion to Stay Proceedings Pending Covered Business Method Review</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Antrag auf Aussetzung des Verfahrens bis zur Überprüfung des gedeckten Geschäftsmethodenverfahrens</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Moción para suspender los procedimientos pendientes de revisión del método de negocio cubierto</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Motion de suspension de la procédure en attendant l&apos;examen de la méthode commerciale couverte</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Motion to Stay Proceedings Pending CBM Review</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Motion to Stay Proceedings Pending Covered Business Method Review</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Pedido de suspensão do processo pendente de revisão do método de negócio coberto</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Solicitud de suspensión de procedimientos pendientes de revisión de método de negocio cubierto</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעה לעצירת הליך בהמתנה לביקורת שיטת עסקים מכוסה</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">कवर्ड बिजनेस मेथड समीक्षा के लिए देरी होने तक प्रक्रिया रोकने की मोशन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">カバードビジネスメソッドレビューを待って訴訟手続きを一時停止する動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">暂停程序，等待覆盖商业方法审查</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Stay Proceedings Pending Covered Business Method (CBM) Review is a request to pause legal proceedings while a review of a specific type of business method patent is conducted.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Ke5k9yA65alqBD0HYDAD -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Ke5k9yA65alqBD0HYDAD">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8alUnZrt8GVEzHYhh1KTva"/>
        <rdfs:label>Future Injury from Present Tortious Personal Injury</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Blessure future résultant d&apos;un préjudice corporel actuel</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Future Injury from Present Tortious Personal Injury</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Lesiones futuras a partir de una lesión personal ilícita presente</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Lesiones futuras a partir de una lesión personal ilícita presente</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Lesão futura decorrente de lesão pessoal ilícita presente</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Zukünftige Verletzung aus gegenwärtiger unerlaubter Handlung</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">פציעה עתידית מפגיעה אישית עוינת נוכחית</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">वर्तमान अनैतिक व्यक्तिगत घायली से भविष्य की घायली</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">现行侵权人身伤害的未来伤害</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">現在の不法行為による将来の傷害</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Future Injury from Present Tortious Personal Injury: A claim for damages resulting from a personal injury that has not yet manifested, but is likely to occur in the future as a direct result of the initial injury.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KfFbgcTnhwv1NgFFh92gR -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KfFbgcTnhwv1NgFFh92gR">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R3bU74bKrSAyu2rkZ4SZEa"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RVcQsyiR3zEN86uQG2Onsy"/>
        <rdfs:label>Carveout for Pandemic Response Language</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Ausnahme für Pandemieantwortsprache</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Carveout for Pandemic Response Language</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Clause d&apos;exclusion pour la langue de réponse à la pandémie</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Exceção para a Linguagem de Resposta à Pandemia</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Exclusión para el Lenguaje de Respuesta a la Pandemia</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Exclusión para el Lenguaje de Respuesta a la Pandemia</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">פיצול לשפת תגובה למגפה</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">पैंडेमिक प्रतिक्रिया भाषा के लिए कार्वआउट</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">パンデミック対応言語の除外条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">应对流行病语言的例外条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A carveout for pandemic response language is a provision in a legal agreement that exempts certain obligations or requirements during a pandemic or other public health emergency.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KhmyuiGXDz10apLAPbLJV -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KhmyuiGXDz10apLAPbLJV">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBJ0dgV4Z2Xk7aGfJt2nSj7"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/REFNhmFYG6yk3W0RPLFV6g"/>
        <dc:source rdf:resource="https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/14.00-Immune-Adult.htm#14_00F1"/>
        <dc:source rdf:resource="https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/14.00-Immune-Adult.htm#14_11"/>
        <rdfs:label>HIV / AIDS</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Immunodeficiency Virus Infection</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>HIV (Human Immunodeficiency Virus) is a virus that attacks the body&apos;s immune system, specifically the CD4 cells (T cells), leading to a weakened immune response. If not treated, HIV can progress to AIDS (Acquired Immunodeficiency Syndrome), the final stage of HIV infection, where the immune system is severely damaged, and the body becomes vulnerable to opportunistic infections and cancers.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KjYkBgyzNInNlmXPMhcXe -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KjYkBgyzNInNlmXPMhcXe">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RC8JmK2y8Na9Itkk0MCtMS4"/>
        <rdfs:label>Military Draft</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Call-Up</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>National Service</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Selective Service</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>&quot;Military Draft,&quot; also known as &quot;Conscription,&quot; refers to the compulsory enlistment of individuals, typically within a specific age range, into the national armed forces. Governments enact conscription during times of war or when they anticipate potential military threats, requiring eligible citizens to serve for a specified period.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Conscription</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Kl2IoHw3qLRSwzUaRXJ6h -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Kl2IoHw3qLRSwzUaRXJ6h">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RxLV9XEaDWbDIA8N1fl2fM"/>
        <rdfs:label>Minnesota District Court - Olmsted County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A court located in Olmsted County, Minnesota that has jurisdiction over civil and criminal cases within its geographical area.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Ko5XSFEDGISXRWlQIT9C9 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Ko5XSFEDGISXRWlQIT9C9">
