        <rdfs:label>Agender</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Agender refers to a gender identity where an individual identifies as having no gender, or a gender that is neutral or undefined. This term falls within the broader spectrum of gender identities and is often acknowledged in legal discussions surrounding gender discrimination, rights, and protections</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


