        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">咨询协议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Consulting Agreement is a legally binding contract between two parties that outlines the terms and conditions of a consulting arrangement, including the scope of work, compensation, and confidentiality provisions.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


