        <rdfs:label>Arbitration Forum</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>An Arbitration Forum is a specific type of Alternative Dispute Resolution (ADR) Forum where disputes are resolved outside of the court system by a neutral third party or panel of experts.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8LtWLYksvZGQK3CyXA0h4 -->

