        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">基尼亚鲁旺达语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Kinyarwanda is a structured system of communication consisting of grammar and vocabulary, used in legal matters, that is specifically spoken in Rwanda and neighboring countries.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8NC79KH4XZ0QKsY297zYPI -->

