        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">研究所 - 不動産資産</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A laboratory is a type of real estate asset, which is a property that is owned or controlled by a person, business, or economic entity and is specifically designed and equipped for scientific research and experimentation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Ol92hxELxA00tCrZWrQDK -->

