        <skos:altLabel>Form I-539</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The &quot;Application to Extend or Change Nonimmigrant Status&quot; refers to Form I-539 in the United States, which is used by individuals in certain non-immigrant visa categories to request an extension of their stay or a change to a different non-immigrant status. This form is commonly used by individuals who want to prolong their stay or switch to a different visa category while remaining in the U.S.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


