        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">基于美元的反垄断标准</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Dollar-Based Antitrust Standard is a legal concept that sets a monetary threshold for determining whether a business practice violates antitrust laws, with the aim of preventing anticompetitive behavior while also allowing for efficient business operations.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


