        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">仮処分命令申立書</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Temporary Restraining Order (TRO) is a legal request for a court order that would prevent a party from taking a certain action until a hearing can be held to determine whether a preliminary injunction should be issued.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8QJDc8SCwsfsJARkyevIJ0 -->

