        <rdfs:label>Lease</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Arrendamiento</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Arrendamiento</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Lease</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Location</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Locação</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Miete</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">השכרת נכס</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">पट्टा</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">リース</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">租赁</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Lease Agreement is a binding contract between a lessor (the owner) and a lessee (the renter) that stipulates the terms and conditions for renting out an asset, such as real estate property or an automobile. The agreement outlines details like the rental amount, lease duration, responsibilities of each party, and other specific provisions related to the rented asset.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RgzFhDdl1pdx5e5pdbOMM -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RgzFhDdl1pdx5e5pdbOMM">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDF3VrmH1eapfkrSQstevLs"/>
        <dc:source rdf:resource="https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/13.00-NeoplasticDiseases-Malignant-Adult.htm#13_20"/>
        <rdfs:label>Pancreatic Cancer</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Pancreatic Carcinoma</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Pancreatic cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the tissues of the pancreas, an organ responsible for aiding digestion and regulating blood sugar. It is often diagnosed at an advanced stage and typically requires treatments such as surgery, chemotherapy, radiation therapy, and targeted therapy.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Pancreas Cancer</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RjNYOqUElQ9CiHuLprZjM -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RjNYOqUElQ9CiHuLprZjM">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7mMPoEuA9Ja4rODr1LGXcR"/>
        <rdfs:label>Joint Work</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Joint Work in copyright law refers to a work produced by the collaboration of two or more authors where their contributions are not separate from each other. This concept is characterized by the intent of the authors to merge their contributions into inseparable or interdependent parts of a unitary whole.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RnHOTDaEMDMEljV8FG18J -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RnHOTDaEMDMEljV8FG18J">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RNoW92yXeKjoc34E3HzcI1"/>
        <rdfs:label>Insurance Deductible Amount</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>An insurance deductible amount, in the context of legal matters, is the portion of a covered loss that the insured party is responsible for paying before the insurance company&apos;s coverage begins.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RojRAoe6WRsBzZCIYHv6a -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RojRAoe6WRsBzZCIYHv6a">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RUM0A3dwvk0A2dp3WHxNrj"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rj3K3GgCUDFW3WWZSB8nsL"/>
        <rdfs:label>Motion for Judgment on Partial Findings</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Antrag auf Urteil auf teilweisen Feststellungen</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Moción de fallo sobre hallazgos parciales</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Moción de fallo sobre hallazgos parciales</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Motion for Judgment on Partial Findings</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Pedido de julgamento com base em constatações parciais</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Requête en jugement sur des constatations partielles</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעה לפסק דין על ממצאים חלקיים</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">आंशिक फैसले पर निर्णय के लिए मोशन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">部分的な判決に関する判決の動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">部分裁决判决动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Judgment on Partial Findings is a legal request made by a party in a case asking the court to rule in their favor on specific issues that have already been decided during the trial.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RpTOwiNs5o1omuvFrx5I7 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RpTOwiNs5o1omuvFrx5I7">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RHfeijrOTjaF7qpuoGIGkR"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCyyVoj3dBNsrCR9jfzhdZz"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>tax_authority_ref</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>In some countries tax invoices must be routed, approved and in some cases even delivered to the customers by a platform controlled and/or imposed by the tax authority.  This platform normally returns an approval code/identifier to the invoice issuer for audit trail purposes.  Such code/identifier may need to be communicated to the customer as a reference depending on the jurisdiction. Use this field to specify the approval code/identifier if required in your country.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RuerKbbGEIA5xqRC8A571 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RuerKbbGEIA5xqRC8A571">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDOvAHsvY8TKJ1O1orXPM9o"/>
        <rdfs:label>Aymara</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Aimará</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Aymara</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Aymara</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">アイマラ語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">艾马拉语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Aymara is a language that belongs to the Language top-level class and is spoken in the Andes region of South America, particularly in Bolivia, Peru, and Chile.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RzOhOfkA2gKQoBAsxgWTd -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RzOhOfkA2gKQoBAsxgWTd">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCy69ZSLkXNMIWCj0nv9qzO"/>
        <rdfs:comment>From LIST: Legal Issues Taxonomy — https://taxonomy.legal/</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Voluntary Employment Termination Event</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Voluntary employment termination event refers to the act of an employee willingly leaving their job, either through resignation or retirement. This is distinct from involuntary termination, where the employer initiates the separation due to reasons like downsizing, performance issues, or misconduct.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S1IGzUlNcKTEKpP4JwiXk -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S1IGzUlNcKTEKpP4JwiXk">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDe0RKU39BlhcyACJW30ZLc"/>
        <rdfs:label>Incorporation of Recitals Clause</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Aufnahme einer Präambelklausel</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Incorporación de la Cláusula de Considerandos</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Incorporación de la Cláusula de Considerandos</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Incorporation d&apos;une clause de considérants</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Incorporation of Recitals Clause</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Incorporação de cláusula de considerandos</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">כלול של סעיף המבואות</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">प्रस्तावना धारा का सम्मिलन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">前文条項の組み込み</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">引入陈述条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Incorporation of Recitals Clause is a specific clause within a contract that references and includes the introductory statements or background information (recitals) of the agreement into the body of the contract itself.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S6XHMUuU5cg5gdDri7LuL -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S6XHMUuU5cg5gdDri7LuL">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDRCaFxX4hpUklgNnVS9D8C"/>
        <dc:source>ABA M&amp;A Deal Points Study</dc:source>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/the.atticus.project/viz/ABADealPointsStudy/Home"/>
        <rdfs:label>Deal Protection and Related Provisions</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Deal Protection and Related Provisions</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Maßnahmen zum Schutz von Geschäftsabschlüssen und verwandte Bestimmungen</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Mesures de protection des transactions et dispositions connexes</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Protección de la operación y disposiciones relacionadas</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Protección de la operación y disposiciones relacionadas</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Proteção de negociações e disposições relacionadas</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הגנת העסקה והוראות קשורות</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">सौदे की संरक्षण और संबंधित विधियाँ</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">交易保护及相关条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">取引保護および関連規定</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Deal Protection and Related Provisions refer to a set of contractual clauses and agreements that are designed to safeguard a merger or acquisition deal from external threats and ensure its successful completion, including provisions such as no-shop covenants, breakup fee triggers, and fiduciary termination rights.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S6z85FPWxd4AVrVeDX7fz -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S6z85FPWxd4AVrVeDX7fz">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7NPSSODp2sRYDRSQ2hvF3b"/>
        <rdfs:label>Breach of Express Warranty</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Breach of Express Warranty</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Incumplimiento de garantía expresa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Incumplimiento de garantía expresa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Verletzung einer ausdrücklichen Garantie</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Violation de garantie explicite</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Violação de garantia expressa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הפרת אחריות מפורשת</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">व्यक्त वारंटी का उल्लंघन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">明示保証違反</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">违反明示保证</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Breach of Express Warranty is a legal concept that occurs when a seller fails to fulfill a specific promise or guarantee made to a buyer regarding the quality or performance of a product, resulting in harm or damages to the buyer.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S7jw4M04j86O7ALCOT3WA -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S7jw4M04j86O7ALCOT3WA">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Xrium2aVaYqlV8F4UZu6u"/>
        <rdfs:label>IP Rights Management</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>IP Rights Management refers to the process of managing and protecting the legal rights associated with intellectual property assets, such as patents, trademarks, and copyrights.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S9ASKtG0EZZj3a4ouaCS -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S9ASKtG0EZZj3a4ouaCS">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rzg8mCIjXsMzEVnQwCTKIi"/>
        <rdfs:label>Pennsylvania Court of Common Pleas -  Franklin County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Pennsylvania Court of Common Pleas - Franklin County is a specific court within the Pennsylvania Court of Common Pleas system, which is responsible for administering legal proceedings in the state of Pennsylvania.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S9Op9EiFQvTngpJ5nyBSg -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S9Op9EiFQvTngpJ5nyBSg">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBB5cexM3974afJhhR2yXHA"/>
        <rdfs:label>Indiana Town Court - Marion County, Decatur Twp.</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A court located in Marion County, Decatur Township, Indiana that has limited jurisdiction over certain types of cases within its geographical area.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SBI3x3TFVnxpSe2TLwn7 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SBI3x3TFVnxpSe2TLwn7">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDe0RKU39BlhcyACJW30ZLc"/>
        <rdfs:label>Salary Deferral Agreement Clause</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Clause d&apos;accord de report de salaire</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Cláusula de Acordo de Adiamento Salarial</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Cláusula de Acuerdo de Diferimiento Salarial</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Cláusula de Acuerdo de Diferimiento Salarial</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Klausel zur Gehaltsabtretungsvereinbarung</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Salary Deferral Agreement Clause</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">סעיף הסכם העברת שכר</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">वेतन अवरण समझौता शर्त</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">工资推迟协议条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">給与支払い先延期契約条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Salary Deferral Agreement Clause is a provision in a contract that allows an employee to defer a portion of their salary to a later date, typically for retirement savings purposes.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SCEafhkCA6MFM4zfjkkIy -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SCEafhkCA6MFM4zfjkkIy">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R79ZRcChNA1jEORJLsPWYSv"/>
        <rdfs:comment>From LIST: Legal Issues Taxonomy — https://taxonomy.legal/</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Increase of Public Benefit</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Increase of public benefit refers to the action of raising the amount or level of financial assistance or services granted to an individual or family under a specific public benefit program. This can occur due to changes in a recipient&apos;s circumstances, such as increased financial hardship, or modifications to eligibility criteria, and usually involves an administrative process for reevaluation and approval.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SK2JSEusj02qBISiZOrIv -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SK2JSEusj02qBISiZOrIv">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RC1ceWXE3emNHpYlrOvvmxG"/>
        <rdfs:label>Lac Vieux Desert Band of Lake Superior Chippewa Indians</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SLYHvXhM4OuMhZqaTzWjg -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SLYHvXhM4OuMhZqaTzWjg">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9EU57yyGYQyG3GeOJ1VgMr"/>
        <rdfs:label>Legal Operations Consulting Services</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Legal Operations Consulting Services refers to professional advice and guidance provided by experts in the field of legal operations management, including strategic planning, process improvement, and technology implementation, to help law firms and legal departments optimize their operations and achieve their business objectives.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SLaqeL3IoFDECzZtRdVVx -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SLaqeL3IoFDECzZtRdVVx">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RVG1zLys64KOCQFR2MhzS7"/>
        <rdfs:label>European Parliament</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Parliament of the European Union</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The European Parliament is one of the legislative bodies of the European Union, composed of members elected by citizens of the member states. It shares the power to legislate, supervise, and budget with the Council of the European Union, representing the interests of EU citizens.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>EU Parliament</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SQ1qC9DBq8ApbGEWH6uD -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SQ1qC9DBq8ApbGEWH6uD">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RKY2B2HNSx5K82dgVN6Qn7"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RtNdCOiqmpVOXZef1DicAV"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Outstanding Professor or Researcher Immigrant Petition</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>An Outstanding Professor or Researcher Immigrant Petition (in the U.S., I-140 EB-1) allows universities or private employers to sponsor foreign nationals who are internationally recognized as outstanding in their academic field. Applicants must demonstrate at least three years of experience in teaching or research and show evidence of significant achievements. Applicants must demonstrate international recognition for your outstanding achievements in a particular academic field, have at least three years of experience in teaching or research in that academic area, and be entering the United States to pursue tenure or a tenure-track teaching position or a comparable research position at a university, institution of higher education, or private employer.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>I-140 EB-1</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SU49WTqAr53LfDfXNnXVp -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SU49WTqAr53LfDfXNnXVp">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDkc9fh6vYvZbJc7ERuIJCf"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBqUJxHCbbdArMkF1DOMXFW"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>L430 Written Motions and Submissions</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A written request or argument submitted to a court or other legal authority during the trial preparation and trial phases of a legal case.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SWmzPcrmcS8LDGj2cz5tY -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SWmzPcrmcS8LDGj2cz5tY">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8H8cpx25KBk3kH55YwSdDv"/>
        <rdfs:label>DUPLICATIVE: Attempt</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>An attempt to duplicate something that is no longer in use.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SXGNWCjQKNR6gemebI0iN -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SXGNWCjQKNR6gemebI0iN">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RC1ceWXE3emNHpYlrOvvmxG"/>
        <rdfs:label>Pueblo of Tesuque</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SXsuhOb76PDAHy1Sk1iYU -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8SXsuhOb76PDAHy1Sk1iYU">
