        <rdfs:label>440 Other Civil Rights (PACER NoS)</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Action alleging a civil rights violation other than the specific civil rights categories listed below or a violation related to prison. Example: Action alleging excessive force by police incident to an arrest. (Excludes claims against corrections officials)</skos:definition>
