        <skos:altLabel>Interest Market Segments</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Psychographic market segment refers to divisions of the market that are categorized based on what consumers think about and value, as well as how they live their lives, including consumers&apos; specific interests, preferences, and passions. This category includes consumers who share a common interest or enthusiasm for particular products, services, activities, or priorities. These segments include areas like health-conscious, tech segment, sustainability segment, and others.</skos:definition>
        <skos:note>Non-copyrightable idea and fact inspiration drawn from IAB 2.0. https://www.meaningcloud.com/developer/documentation/predefined/deep-categorization-models/iab-2-0</skos:note>
