        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">請求制限動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">限制权利要求动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Limit Claims is a formal request made during a trial to restrict the scope of claims or issues that can be raised by a party, typically to prevent undue prejudice or confusion.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


