        <rdfs:label>Statute of Repose</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Lei de Repouso</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Ley de prescripción</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Ley de prescripción</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Loi de prescription</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Statute of Repose</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Verjährungsgesetz</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">חוק הפסקת התביעה</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">रिपोज कानून</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">时效法规</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">時効法</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Statute of Repose is a legal time limit that restricts the period within which a lawsuit can be filed, regardless of when the injury or harm occurred or was discovered. It is usually tied to the completion of a specific event or transaction, such as the sale of a product or the completion of construction.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


