        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">破产第二天动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">破産2日目の動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Bankruptcy Second Day Motions are requests made by a debtor in a bankruptcy case within the first few days after filing for bankruptcy, seeking relief from certain requirements or restrictions imposed by the bankruptcy code or court rules.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


