        <rdfs:label>DEPRECATED Budgeting and Project Management</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Deprecated Budgeting and Project Management refers to the outdated process of planning and controlling financial resources and activities related to a specific project, which is no longer in use.</skos:definition>
