        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">調停アンケート提出期限延長申立書</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Extend Time to File Mediation Questionnaire is a formal request made to the appellate court to allow additional time for a party to submit a questionnaire related to mediation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


