        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">和解に伴う手続きの一時停止の申立て</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">暂停诉讼程序等待和解动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Stay Proceedings Pending Settlement is a legal request to temporarily halt a case until the parties involved can reach a settlement agreement.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


