        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">投资者</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An investor is a person, company or entity that qualifies under the Securities Act of 1933 and related Securities and Exchange Commission regulations as one having sufficient knowledge and expertise in financial matters to weigh the value and risks of an investment.</skos:definition>
