        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">裁判の種類：裁判官または陪審員</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Trial Type is a subcategory of Trial Events and refers to the type of trial, which can be either Bench or Jury.</skos:definition>
