        <skos:altLabel>R-1 Visa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>This visa (in the U.S., R-1 visa) is a non-immigrant visa designated for religious workers who are coming to the destination country (e.g., U.S.) to work in a religious capacity. The initial period of stay can be up to 30 months, with the possibility of extending for an additional 30 months, for a maximum total stay of 60 months</skos:definition>
