        <skos:definition>The concept of &quot;Credit Issuer Dishonoring or Repudiating&quot; refers to the act of a bank or other entity failing to honor or refusing to acknowledge a debt or obligation owed to a creditor, typically involving commercial paper or other financial instruments.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8lGEk1h42ZjiKM5FK2X7xb -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8lGEk1h42ZjiKM5FK2X7xb">
