        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">违反禁止购物契约</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Breach of No-Shop Covenant refers to the violation of a contractual agreement between parties involved in a business transaction, where one party agrees not to solicit or entertain offers from other potential buyers for a specified period of time.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


