        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">商业外观淡化</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Trade Dress Dilution refers to a legal claim that protects the distinctiveness and uniqueness of a company&apos;s product or service design from being weakened or diluted by similar designs used by competitors, which may cause confusion among consumers.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


