        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">早期終了条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Early Termination Clause is a provision in a contract that allows one or both parties to end the agreement before its natural expiration date.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


