        <rdfs:label>Trees</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Arboreal Plants</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Ligneous Plants</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Trees are perennial woody plants characterized by a single main stem or trunk, supporting branches and leaves. They play a critical role in ecosystems by providing oxygen, habitats, and food for various species, and are essential for maintaining environmental balance.</skos:definition>
