        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">ロマンス諸語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">罗曼语系</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Romance languages are a group of languages that evolved from Latin and are primarily spoken in Western Europe and Latin America.</skos:definition>
