        <rdfs:label>O-2 Visa</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>An O-2 visa is issued to individuals who provide essential support services to O-1 visa holders, allowing them to enter the U.S. to assist in the performance of the O-1 visa holder’s work. This visa category includes personnel whose skills are integral to the successful performance of the O-1 visa holder.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Support Staff Visa For Extraordinary Talent</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


