        <skos:definition>A Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court - Indiana County is a specific court within the Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court system that has jurisdiction over minor criminal offenses and civil cases within Indiana County.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8sHsF4adEDXfQchK10ak0E -->

