        <rdfs:label>Drug Test</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Toxicology Test</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A drug test is a technical analysis of a biological specimen, such as urine, hair, blood, breath, sweat, or oral fluid/saliva, to determine the presence or absence of specified drugs or their metabolites. These tests are often used by employers, sports organizations, legal and law enforcement agencies, and in healthcare settings.</skos:definition>
