        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">泌尿妇科医疗事故</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Urogynecology Malpractice refers to a type of medical malpractice claim that involves injuries or harm caused by the negligence or misconduct of a urogynecologist, who specializes in the treatment of pelvic floor disorders in women.</skos:definition>
