        <rdfs:label>Motion for Relief due to Satisfaction, Release, or Discharge</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Antrag auf Erleichterung aufgrund von Erfüllung, Freilassung oder Entlassung</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Moción de alivio debido a la satisfacción, liberación o descarga</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Motion for Relief due to Satisfaction, Release, or Discharge</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Petição de Alívio devido a Satisfação, Liberação ou Descarga</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Requête en vue d&apos;une mesure de soulagement en raison de la satisfaction, de la libération ou du déchargement</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Solicitud de alivio debido a la satisfacción, liberación o descarga</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעה להקלה עקב הסכמה, שחרור או שחרור</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">संतुष्टि, रिहाई या डिस्चार्ज के कारण राहत के लिए मोशन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">因满足、释放或解除而提出的救济动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">満足、解放、または解除による救済のための動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>FRCP 60(b)(5)</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8yACT4dUODpftG6r9jIYvu -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8yACT4dUODpftG6r9jIYvu">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDOvAHsvY8TKJ1O1orXPM9o"/>
        <rdfs:label>Creoles and pidgins</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Crioulos e pidgins</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Créoles et pidgins</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Kreolisch und Pidgin-Sprachen</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">クレオール言語とピジン言語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">克里奥尔语和皮钦语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A creole or pidgin language is a simplified language that develops as a means of communication between groups who do not share a common language.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8yBi7eGC3bVzVUorDn1llP -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8yBi7eGC3bVzVUorDn1llP">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RjKL1UdfWL1FCPVhnbIFSF"/>
        <dc:identifier>RRL-LITA</dc:identifier>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=533"/>
        <rdfs:label>Lessors of Nonfinancial Intangible Assets (except Copyrighted Works) Industry</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Bailleurs d&apos;actifs immatériels non financiers</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Industria de arrendamiento de activos intangibles no financieros</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Industria de arrendamiento de activos intangibles no financieros</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Lessors of Non-financial Intangible Assets Industry</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Lessors of Nonfinancial Intangible Assets</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Locadores de Ativos Intangíveis Não Financeiros</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Vermieter von nicht-finanziellen immateriellen Vermögenswerten</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תעשיית משכירי נכסים לא-פיננסיים אינטנגיבלים</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">गैर-वित्तीय असंचालित अस्तित्वों के लेसर्स उद्योग</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">非金融无形资产出租业</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">非金融無形資産の貸し手業界</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Industries in the Lessors of Nonfinancial Intangible Assets (except Copyrighted Works) subsector include establishments primarily engaged in assigning rights to assets, such as patents, trademarks, brand names, and/or franchise agreements, for which a royalty payment or licensing fee is paid to the asset holder.  Establishments in this subsector own the patents, trademarks, and/or franchise agreements that they allow others to use or reproduce for a fee and may or may not have created those assets.

Establishments that allow franchisees the use of the franchise name, contingent on the franchisee buying products or services from the franchisor, are classified elsewhere.

Excluded from this subsector are establishments primarily engaged in leasing real property and establishments primarily engaged in leasing tangible assets, such as automobiles, computers, consumer goods, and industrial machinery and equipment.  These establishments are classified in Subsector 531, Real Estate, and Subsector 532, Rental and Leasing Services, respectively.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel>LITA</skos:hiddenLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8yCcIDk4ClOn2BKn5i87nd -->

