        <rdfs:label>California Superior Court - Kern Cty.</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A California Superior Court - Kern Cty. is a specific court within the California Superior Court system that has jurisdiction over legal matters within Kern County.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8yMujIQU7LoqtdvdjNpAV9 -->

