        <rdfs:label>Graffiti</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Tagging Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Unauthorized Public Marking Offense</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Graffiti Claim is a criminal misdemeanor charge alleging that an individual has defaced property by painting, marking, or inscribing surfaces without the owner&apos;s consent. This legal action asserts that the accused has engaged in vandalism through the unauthorized application of graffiti, potentially causing property damage and public nuisance.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Defacement Allegation</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


