        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">提案された陪審員指示</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Proposed Jury Instructions are written statements that explain the law to the jury and guide them in their decision-making process, submitted by the parties in a trial for the judge&apos;s consideration.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


