        <rdfs:label>Driver&apos;s License</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Motor Vehicle License</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A driver&apos;s license is a legal document issued by governmental authorities that authorizes an individual to operate a motor vehicle on public roads. The license is typically granted after the individual has passed both written and practical driving tests, and it may come with restrictions based on age, type of vehicle, or other factors.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


