        <rdfs:comment>From LIST: Legal Issues Taxonomy — https://taxonomy.legal/</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Ability to Work</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Ability to work refers to an individual&apos;s physical and mental capacity to perform tasks required for specific jobs or professions. This criterion is often assessed in the context of eligibility for disability or unemployment benefits, as well as in employment settings.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


