        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">適切な保護のための動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Adequate Protection is a legal request made in a bankruptcy case to ensure that a creditor&apos;s interest in collateral is protected during the bankruptcy proceedings.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


