        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">缺乏主题管辖权</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The lack of subject matter jurisdiction is a defense raised in a civil litigation that argues that the court does not have the authority to hear the case due to the nature of the legal claim or the parties involved.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


