        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">一般解除条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A general release clause is a provision in a contract that releases one or both parties from all claims and liabilities arising from the subject matter of the contract.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


