        <skos:altLabel>Fully Collateralized Warrant</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Secured Warrant</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Third-Party Covered Warrant</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Covered Warrant is a financial instrument issued by a third party that is not the issuer of the underlying securities to which the warrant refers. The issuer of the covered warrant holds a sufficient quantity of the underlying securities to cover all the warrants if they are exercised, providing a level of security to the warrant holders.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Third-Party Backed Warrant</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


