        <rdfs:label>tax_tier_summary segment</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>&quot;Summarizes the Tiered Taxes charged on this matter/invoice detailed in TAX_TIER_DETAIL by tx_id.  There will be 0 or more TAX_TIER_SUMMARY segments per INVOICE segment.  There will be 1 TAX_TIER_SUMMARY segment for each TAX.tx_id where TAX.&apos;tax_tiers = &quot;&quot;Y&quot;&quot;.

Note that the EXTEND_HEADER option was purposely omitted from this segment.
&quot;</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


