        <rdfs:label>Severe Traumatic Brain Injury</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Severe traumatic brain injury (TBI) is a critical condition caused by a significant impact or force to the head, resulting in extended loss of consciousness or amnesia, severe cognitive impairments, and potential long-term disabilities. It often necessitates emergency medical intervention, intensive care, and prolonged rehabilitation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


