        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">律师-客户特权</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Attorney-Client Privilege is a legal concept that protects the confidentiality of communications between an attorney and their client, and prevents those communications from being disclosed without the client&apos;s consent.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


