        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">随时雇佣条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An &quot;At Will Employment Clause&quot; is a provision in a contract that allows either the employer or employee to terminate the employment relationship at any time, without cause or notice.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


