        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">事実上の没収</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of De Facto Taking refers to a situation where the government takes private property without following the proper legal procedures for eminent domain or taking, resulting in the property owner being deprived of their rights without compensation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


