        <rdfs:label>matter_disc_cred segment</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The &quot;matter_disc_cred segment&quot; is a component of the LEDES XML E-Billing Ver. 2.2 standard that includes information related to discounts or credits applied to a matter, such as the type, amount, and category of the discount or credit.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


