        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">拒绝条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Stipulation to Reject is a legal agreement between parties in which they agree to reject or disallow certain evidence or arguments in a case.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


