        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">請求書終了日</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The &quot;Invoice End Date&quot; is a specific detail within the broader category of &quot;Fee Invoice Detail&quot; and refers to the date on which an invoice for legal services is due to be paid.</skos:definition>
