        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">実際の知識言語における重大な不利な影響の定義</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>&quot;Actual Knowledge&quot; Language refers to a clause in a contract that outlines the specific circumstances under which a party can terminate the agreement if there is a significant negative impact on the financial condition or operations of the other party, and the party seeking to terminate has actual knowledge of such impact.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


