        <skos:altLabel>Money Raising</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Fundraising refers to the process of gathering monetary contributions from individuals, businesses, charitable foundations, or governmental agencies. It is often undertaken by non-profit organizations, political campaigns, startup companies, or for specific causes or projects.</skos:definition>
