        <rdfs:label>Navy</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Maritime Forces</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Naval Forces</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Navy is the maritime branch of a nation&apos;s armed forces, responsible for naval warfare, sea control, and projection of power across bodies of water. This military organization operates various types of warships, submarines, and aircraft to defend a nation&apos;s territorial waters, protect maritime interests, and conduct operations at sea.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9LZRvWUmDK8LjGg73Eo5pF -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9LZRvWUmDK8LjGg73Eo5pF">
