        <rdfs:label>Passport Issued Date</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Passport Issued Date refers to the specific day, month, and year on which an individual&apos;s passport was issued by the relevant government authority. This information is recorded in the passport and is used for identification and verification purposes during travel and various legal processes.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


