        <rdfs:label>Records Management</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Records Management refers to the systematic and efficient control of an organization&apos;s records, including their creation, maintenance, use, and disposition, in order to meet legal, regulatory, and business requirements.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9MIxL13U9KCyyHGinZYTBx -->

