        <rdfs:label>Resolutions</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Resolutions are formal decisions or actions adopted by an organization&apos;s governing body, usually ratified through a voting process. They serve to document and implement specific actions, policies, or organizational changes.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


