        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">银行处理资金转移不当</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Bank Mishandling Funds Transfer refers to a legal claim made by a creditor against a bank for improperly handling the transfer of funds, which may involve commercial paper and banking regulations.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


