        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">驳回索赔动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Dismiss Claim is a formal request made by a party in a legal case to have a claim against them dismissed by the court.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9MVhcSKkXJDVsx44Ww5zfU -->

