        <rdfs:label>Small Claims / Conciliation Court</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Conciliation Court</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Small Claims/Conciliation Court is a specific type of court forum that has jurisdiction over disputes involving small amounts of money or property and aims to resolve them through conciliation rather than traditional litigation.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Small Claims Court</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9MpQtdNXG0cBUT2q3pHhyv -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9MpQtdNXG0cBUT2q3pHhyv">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rfw7NfMHyrhfFQj8ob4M4U"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7KYfSpf0bnFF3LV3RL3YU"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCG4QF2vhgY9jI81Z8dII42"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RFBFa05A797a0E88e0a5F580"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Unlawful Picketing Claim</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Klage wegen ungesetzlicher Streikposten</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Reclamación de Piquetes Ilegales</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Reclamo de Piquetes Ilegales</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Reivindicação de piquete ilegal</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Réclamation de piquetage illégal</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Unlawful Picketing Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Violent Picketing Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעה על פקק פורעני לא חוקי</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">अवैध पिकेटिंग दावा</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">違法なピケ行為の主張</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">非法罢工申诉</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An unlawful picketing claim is a legal action initiated by an employer, individual, or entity alleging that a labor union or group of employees has engaged in picketing activities that violate the law or infringe upon their rights. Picketing typically involves organized protests by workers outside a workplace to express grievances, support labor disputes, or raise awareness about certain issues. While picketing is generally protected under the National Labor Relations Act (NLRA) and the First Amendment, it may be deemed unlawful if it involves activities such as violence, threats, intimidation, mass picketing that obstructs access to a business, or secondary picketing targeting neutral parties not involved in the labor dispute. An unlawful picketing claim may be filed with the National Labor Relations Board (NLRB) or pursued through the court system.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


