        <rdfs:label>Immigration Regulatory Objectives</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Immigration Regulatory Objectives: The specific aims, goals, plans, and intentions related to the regulation of immigration, including the legal frameworks and policies.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


