        <rdfs:label>Summer Associate</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Legal Trainee</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Summer Clerk</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Summer Law Clerk</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Summer Associate is a law student working in a law firm over the summer, often to assess mutual fit between the student and the firm. The experience often culminates in the firm extending an offer for a permanent position upon the student&apos;s graduation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


