        <skos:definition>The concept of Project Management, within the context of Legal Operations and the Business of Law, involves the planning, organizing, and overseeing of legal projects to ensure successful completion within the given constraints of time, budget, and resources.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9ScOJG3nAJxNPgzRjqXYXk -->

