        <rdfs:label>Texas Court of Appeals - 13th</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Texas Court of Appeals - 13th is a specific court within the Texas Court of Appeals system that hears appeals from trial courts in certain counties and has jurisdiction over civil and criminal cases.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


