        <skos:definition>The arid market segment targets consumers or businesses located in regions characterized by dry, desert-like conditions with minimal rainfall. Businesses catering to this segment often focus on products and services that address the challenges of living in arid climates, such as water conservation, cooling solutions, and sun protection.</skos:definition>
