        <rdfs:label>Bananas</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Musa Fruit</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Bananas are a tropical fruit crop produced by various species of large herbaceous plants in the Musa genus, known for their elongated shape and sweet, creamy flesh. Consumed worldwide, they serve as a vital source of nutrients, including potassium and vitamins B6 and C, and are used in a wide range of culinary applications.</skos:definition>
