        <skos:altLabel>Articles of Association</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Corporate Articles, also known as Articles of Incorporation, are legal documents filed with a government body to officially establish a corporation. They outline fundamental information such as the corporation&apos;s name, purpose, and stock structure.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Articles of Incorporation</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


