        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">監査条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An audit clause is a provision in a contract that allows one party to inspect and review the financial records of the other party to ensure compliance with the terms of the agreement.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


