        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">马都雷斯语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Madurese is a structured system of communication consisting of grammar and vocabulary, and is a specific language within the context of legal matters.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


