        <rdfs:label>Construction Permit</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Construction Permit is an official authorization issued by a governmental body that allows the holder to commence construction, modification, or demolition of a building or structure. It ensures that the proposed work complies with local building codes, zoning laws, and safety regulations.</skos:definition>
