        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">救急車の過失</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">救护车疏忽</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Ambulance Negligence refers to a legal claim for damages resulting from the failure of ambulance personnel to provide appropriate medical care or transport in emergency situations.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9ZnPQz0FrHlGYSKC7WWuY -->

