        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">रद्द करने के लिए आवेदन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">取り消し動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">撤销动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Quash is a legal request to invalidate or nullify a legal document (e.g., subpoena, service of process, order). It is typically filed on procedural or jurisdictional grounds to prevent further legal proceedings based on the challenged document.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


