        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">利害関係声明</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Statement of Interest is a written document submitted to a court or other legal authority expressing a party&apos;s position or opinion on a particular matter, typically in relation to an appeal or other legal proceeding.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


