        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">简易确认动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Summary Affirmance is a legal document requesting a court to affirm a lower court&apos;s decision without a full appeal process, based on the belief that the decision was correct and legally sound.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


