        <skos:definition>A Regulatory Notice is an official communication issued by a governmental or regulatory body to inform organizations or the public about new laws, updates to existing regulations, or other important compliance-related matters. It serves as a mechanism to ensure that affected parties are aware of their legal obligations.</skos:definition>
