        <rdfs:label>Spinocerebellar Degeneration</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Spinocerebellar degeneration is a group of progressive neurological disorders characterized by the degeneration of the spinal cord and cerebellum, leading to impaired motor coordination, balance, and sensory functions. This condition often manifests with symptoms such as ataxia, gait disturbances, and loss of coordination.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


