        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">赎回动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Redeem is a legal request made in a bankruptcy case by a debtor to retain ownership of a property by paying off the creditor&apos;s claim in full.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


