        <rdfs:label>New York Supreme Court - Wayne County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The New York Supreme Court - Wayne County is a court of general jurisdiction located in Wayne County, New York, with authority to hear and decide a wide range of civil and criminal cases.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


