        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">पहले अधिकार से इनकार करने की शर्त का अस्वीकार</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">優先購入権放棄条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">放弃优先购买权条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Waiver of Right of First Refusal Clause is a provision in a contract that allows a party to give up their right to be the first to purchase or lease a property or asset before it is offered to others.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


