        <rdfs:label>Mineral Rights</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Mineral rights pertain to the ownership and control of the minerals (like coal, oil, and gas) beneath a plot of land. The owner of mineral rights can lease, sell, or transfer these rights to others.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


