        <skos:altLabel>Elite Performer Visa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Talent Visa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An O-1 visa is issued to individuals with extraordinary ability in the sciences, arts, education, business, or athletics, recognized at a national or international level. This visa allows them to enter the U.S. to continue work in their field of expertise.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Extraordinary Ability Non-Immigrant Visa</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


