        <rdfs:label>Gallbladder Cancer</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Biliary Cancer</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Gallbladder Carcinoma</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Gallbladder cancer is a type of cancer that originates in the gallbladder, a small organ beneath the liver that stores bile. It is often diagnosed at an advanced stage due to its asymptomatic nature in early stages, and typically requires treatments such as surgery, chemotherapy, and radiation therapy.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


