        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">租金覆盖率条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Rent Coverage Ratio Clause is a provision in a contract that requires a tenant to maintain a certain level of income in order to ensure they can afford to pay rent.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


