        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">サーミ語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">萨米语言</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Sami languages are a group of languages that are spoken by the Sami people in northern Europe, including Norway, Sweden, Finland, and Russia.</skos:definition>
