        <rdfs:label>Billable</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Chargeable</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Compensable</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Invoicable</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The term &quot;Billable&quot; refers to whether a legal service provider can charge a client for time spent or tasks completed on the client&apos;s behalf. This concept encompasses activities that are directly related to delivering legal services and are eligible for invoicing.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


