        <skos:altLabel>Personal Effects</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Personal Property</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Often considered in Bankruptcy Proceedings, Personal Goods are movable, tangible objects owned by an individual and primarily used for personal, household, or everyday living purposes. They are distinct from real property (real estate) and intellectual property.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


