        <skos:altLabel>&quot;Adverse impact on ability to consummate&quot; Language</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Anwendung von Forward-Looking MAE - Sprache &quot;Adverse Auswirkungen auf die Fähigkeit zur Durchführung&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Aplicação de Forward-Looking MAE - Linguagem &quot;Impacto adverso na capacidade de consumar&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Application de Forward-Looking MAE - Langue &quot;Impact négatif sur la capacité à mener à bien&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">Forward-Looking MAE アプリケーション - &quot;完了能力への不利な影響&quot; 言語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Forward-looking MAE Application - &quot;Adverse impact on ability to consummate&quot; Language</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Solicitud de MAE prospectivo - Lenguaje de &quot;Impacto adverso en la capacidad de consumar&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Solicitud de MAE prospectivo - Lenguaje de &quot;Impacto adverso en la capacidad de consumar&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">יישום MAE המבטיח - שפת &quot;השפעה שלילית על היכולת להשלים&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">फॉरवर्ड-लुकिंग एमएई एप्लिकेशन - &quot;कन्समेट करने की क्षमता पर नकारात्मक प्रभाव&quot; भाषा</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">前瞻性 MAE 应用 - &quot;对完成能力的不利影响&quot; 语言</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The &quot;Adverse impact on ability to consummate&quot; Language refers to a provision in a legal agreement that outlines the potential negative effects on the ability to complete a transaction, and is part of the Forward-looking Material Adverse Effect (MAE) Standard.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


