        <rdfs:label>Indiana Superior Court - Lawrence County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Indiana Superior Court - Lawrence County: A court of general jurisdiction in Indiana that has the authority to hear and decide a wide range of legal cases within Lawrence County.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9q7GJc1zsYT0P4Xdp6l9Oz -->

