        <skos:altLabel>Symbolist Model</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Expert System is an automated system encoded with the knowledge of human experts, typically utilizing knowledge representation techniques. These systems are focused on narrow tasks and employ automated decision-making based on &quot;if-then&quot; rules to simulate the expertise of human specialists in specific domains.</skos:definition>
