        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">未成年者の保護</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A conservatorship of juvenile is a legal arrangement where a court appoints a responsible adult to care for a minor&apos;s personal and financial needs when the minor&apos;s parents are unable to do so.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


