        <skos:definition>A Dispute Venue is a specific type of Forum or Venue that is responsible for administering legal proceedings related to disputes, including Courts, Alternative Dispute Resolution (ADR) Venues, Legislative Proceedings, and Administrative Proceeding Venues.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


