        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">調停へのケースの参照に関する動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Refer Case to Mediation is a formal request made by a party in a legal case to have the case referred to a mediator for resolution, rather than proceeding to trial or appeal.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


