        <rdfs:label>New York Supreme Court - Essex County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The New York Supreme Court - Essex County is a court of general jurisdiction located in Essex County, New York, with authority to hear and decide a wide range of legal disputes within its geographical jurisdiction.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


