        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">租赁物业条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">賃貸物件条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Leased Premises Clause is a provision in a contract that outlines the terms and conditions of a lease agreement for a specific property.</skos:definition>
