        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Petição para dispensa de comparecimento na reunião 341</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">בקשה לפטור מהופעה בפגישת 341</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">豁免出席341会议动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Waive Appearance at 341 Meeting is a request made in a bankruptcy case to excuse the debtor from attending the meeting of creditors, which is typically required by law.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


