        <skos:definition>This group comprises establishments primarily engaged in offering job or career vocational or technical courses. The curriculums offered by these schools are highly structured and specialized and lead to job-specific certification. Examples include Bartending schools, Modeling schools, Broadcasting schools, Real estate schools, Computer repair training, and Truck driving schools.</skos:definition>
