        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">国家经济委员会</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The National Economic Council (NEC) of the United States is the principal forum used by the President of the United States for considering economic policy matters, separate from matters relating to domestic policy, which are the domain of the Domestic Policy Council. The council forms part of the Office of White House Policy which contains the National Economic Council and other offices.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel>NEC</skos:hiddenLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel>National Economic Council</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


