        <dc:source rdf:resource="https://www.wolterskluwer.com/en/expert-insights/benefit-llcs-an-option-for-socially-conscious-business-owners"/>
        <rdfs:label>Benefit Limited Liability Company</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Benefit LLC</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Benefit Limited Liability Company (BLLC) is a type of limited liability company that combines the liability protection of a traditional LLC with a commitment to pursuing public benefits alongside profit. These companies are structured to focus on social and environmental goals while still operating as for-profit entities.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>BLLC</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


