        <rdfs:label>TIMEKEEPER_FIRST_NAME</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The concept of TIMEKEEPER_FIRST_NAME refers to the first name of an individual who is responsible for tracking and recording time spent on legal tasks, as defined within the LEDES98BI V5 Format Rev 1-2020 standard.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


