        <rdfs:label>Sheep</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Ovine Animals</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Sheep are domesticated ruminant animals belonging to the species Ovis aries, commonly raised for their wool, meat (lamb or mutton), and milk. They are known for their grazing habits and flocking behavior, and they play an important role in agriculture and textile industries.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


