        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">控訴記録の訂正申立</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">纠正上诉记录动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Correct the Record on Appeal is a legal request made to a higher court to amend or supplement the record of a lower court proceeding in order to accurately reflect the facts presented during the trial.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


