        <skos:altLabel>Crisis Information Management</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Reputation Management Advisory</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Crisis Communications Practice involves providing legal advice and services related to managing and disseminating information during crises, aimed at protecting and maintaining an entity&apos;s reputation and legal standing. This practice addresses communication strategies, media relations, and stakeholder engagement in high-pressure situations.</skos:definition>
