        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">肯定的な弁護</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Affirmative Defenses are legal arguments raised by a defendant in response to a plaintiff&apos;s claim, which if proven, can defeat or mitigate the plaintiff&apos;s claim, and must be asserted by the defendant in their answer or other responsive pleading.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBArQMGGQsqMjU7hWmLA0y2 -->

