        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">दोहराने के लिए देर से याचिका दाखिल करने का अनुरोध</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">再審請求の遅延申請に対する動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">提交延迟申请再审的动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to File Late Petition for Rehearing (To File Motion and Petition for Rehearing Together) is a request made to an appellate court to allow a party to submit a petition for rehearing after the deadline has passed, while also submitting the motion and petition together.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


