        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">辩后信函简述</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Post-Argument Letter Brief is a written document submitted to an appellate court after oral arguments have been made, providing additional information or arguments in support of a party&apos;s position.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


