        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">破産事件の終結に関する実務</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The practice of completing the necessary legal procedures and actions to formally close a bankruptcy case.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


