        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">默示合同违约</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">黙示契約違反</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Breach of Implied-in-Fact Contract refers to a situation where one party fails to fulfill the obligations that were not explicitly stated but were understood by both parties to be a part of their agreement.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBBo7LrufcJPANNOwnbIYo1 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBBo7LrufcJPANNOwnbIYo1">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDkqXQLaqeFlhG4isnkHJuv"/>
        <rdfs:label>Ex Post Facto Clause Claim</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Anspruch auf Klausel ex post facto</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Ex Post Facto Clause Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Reclamo de Cláusula Ex Post Facto</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Reclamo de Cláusula Ex Post Facto</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Reivindicação de cláusula ex post facto</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Réclamation de clause ex post facto</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעת סעיף אקס פוסט פקטו</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">एक्स पोस्ट फैक्टो क्लॉज क्लेम</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">事后法律条款索赔</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">事後法条項請求</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Ex Post Facto Clause claim is a legal argument asserting that a law or action violates the Ex Post Facto Clause of the United States Constitution. This claim contends that the law or action retroactively imposes punishment or changes the legal consequences of an act, which is prohibited by the Ex Post Facto Clause.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


