        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">补充或修改记者记录指定动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">記録者の記録の指定の補足または修正の動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Supplement or Amend Designation of Reporter Transcript is a legal request to modify or add to the previously designated transcript of a court proceeding, typically filed after the original transcript has been produced.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBCle3AEWxsyVj6VM0ZLdq -->

