        <rdfs:label>Washington Superior Court - Snohomish County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Washington Superior Court - Snohomish County refers to a specific court within the Washington Superior Court system that has jurisdiction over legal matters in Snohomish County.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


