        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">图瓦卢</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Tuvalu (Language) is a structured system of communication that consists of grammar and vocabulary specific to the Tuvalu islands.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


