        <skos:altLabel>Enhanced Reality Experience</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Augmented Reality Experience overlays digital information, such as images, sounds, or other data, onto the real-world environment, enhancing the user&apos;s perception and interaction with their surroundings. Protected under copyright law, augmented reality experiences grant creators exclusive rights to reproduce, distribute, and display the content.</skos:definition>
