        <rdfs:label>Lawful AI</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Legally Compliant AI</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Regulation-Compliant AI</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Regulation-Conformant AI</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Lawful AI refers to AI systems designed and operated in full compliance with all applicable laws and regulations. This ensures that AI systems adhere to legal standards across jurisdictions, including privacy laws, anti-discrimination statutes, data protection regulations, and industry-specific legal requirements.</skos:definition>
