            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Social Security Funding Objective</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The social security funding objective aims to ensure the financial sustainability of a social security system, which provides benefits such as retirement income, disability payments, and healthcare coverage. This objective involves strategies for collecting sufficient revenues through taxes or contributions and managing expenditures to maintain long-term solvency.</skos:definition>
