        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">在不公平情况下租赁的消费品</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Consumer Goods Leased Under Unconscionable Circumstances refers to the situation where a consumer leases goods from a party who has taken advantage of the consumer&apos;s vulnerability, lack of bargaining power, or inability to understand the terms of the lease agreement, resulting in an unfair and unreasonable contract.</skos:definition>
