        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">美国国税局豁免税和政府实体部门</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The IRS Tax Exempt and Governments Entities Division of the IRS provides administrative guidance to their examiners to ensure consistent tax administration and on matters relating to internal operations. The administrative guidance can be in the form of interim guidance or directives; they don&apos;t establish the IRS&apos;s position on legal issues and are not legal guidance.</skos:definition>
