        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">侵入</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">入侵</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Intrusion refers to a type of privacy claim that involves intentional and offensive interference with an individual&apos;s solitude or private affairs, which would be highly offensive to a reasonable person.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


