        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">禁令救济条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Injunctive Relief Clause is a provision in a contract that allows a party to seek a court order to prevent the other party from taking certain actions or to compel them to perform certain obligations.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


