        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">民事請求の要素</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Elements of Civil Claim are the specific components that must be present in a legal claim brought in civil court, including facts, legal theories, and damages sought.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


