        <skos:altLabel>Scholarly Reviewed</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Peer Reviewed indicates that a document has undergone a formal evaluation by experts in the same field to assess its validity, significance, and originality. This characteristic is often considered a marker of academic rigor and credibility.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


