        <skos:altLabel>Marine Vessel</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Nautical Vessel</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Watercraft is a vehicle designed for travel on or in water, including boats, ships, submarines, and personal watercraft. These vessels are used for various purposes such as transportation, recreation, military operations, and commercial activities.</skos:definition>
