        <rdfs:label>Foreign Private Issuer Report</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Foreign Private Issuer Report is a document filed by foreign companies listed on U.S. exchanges, summarizing financial and operational data. It is a U.S.-specific requirement aimed at standardizing information for U.S. investors.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>International Company Disclosure</skos:prefLabel>
