        <skos:definition>The Pennsylvania Court of Common Pleas - Elk County is a specific court within the Pennsylvania Court of Common Pleas system, which is responsible for administering legal proceedings in Elk County, Pennsylvania.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


