        <skos:altLabel>Key Business Contracts</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Material Contracts are key contracts that a company is obligated to disclose because they significantly affect the company&apos;s operations, financial condition, or liquidity. These are typically included as exhibits in regulatory filings.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Significant Agreements</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


