        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">贡献索赔</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Contribution Claim is a legal claim made by a defendant seeking to recover a portion of damages paid to a plaintiff from another party who is also responsible for the same harm.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


