        <skos:altLabel>Asperger Syndrome</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Pervasive Developmental Disorder</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD) is a neurodevelopmental disorder characterized by persistent difficulties in social communication and interaction, along with restricted, repetitive patterns of behavior, interests, or activities. The severity and manifestations of symptoms vary widely among individuals, making it a spectrum disorder.</skos:definition>
