        <rdfs:label>Indiana Circuit Court - Wells County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Indiana Circuit Court - Wells County is a specific court within the Indiana Circuit Court system that has jurisdiction over legal matters within Wells County, Indiana.</skos:definition>
