        <skos:definition>Georgia Superior Court - Pierce County: A court of general jurisdiction in the state of Georgia that has authority over civil and criminal cases within Pierce County.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBMzAubKIfSv3tlENcrp313 -->

