        <rdfs:label>Contact Name Suffix - IV (Fourth)</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>The Fourth</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The suffix &quot;IV&quot; stands for &quot;Fourth&quot; and is used after a person&apos;s full name to indicate that they are the fourth generation in their family to bear that name. This suffix is used to differentiate among family members in formal, legal, or financial contexts.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>IV</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


