        <skos:altLabel>Patient Form</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Medical Form is a standardized document used within healthcare settings for collecting, storing, or conveying information related to a patient&apos;s medical history, condition, or treatment. Examples include consent forms, referral forms, and records release forms.</skos:definition>
