        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">非招揽协议条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Non-Solicitation Agreement Clause is a provision in a contract that prohibits one party from soliciting or hiring employees or clients of the other party for a specified period of time after the termination of the contract.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


