        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">新审判动议 - 新发现的证据</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for New Trial - Newly Discovered Evidence is a legal request made by a party to a case asking the court to grant a new trial based on evidence that was not available during the original trial and could have changed the outcome.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


