        <rdfs:label>Chickens</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Chickens are domesticated birds belonging to the species Gallus gallus domesticus, commonly raised for their meat, eggs, and feathers. They are one of the most widespread and important sources of protein in agriculture, with numerous breeds adapted for specific purposes such as egg-laying or meat production.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


