        <skos:definition>Changes in Target&apos;s Industry Language refers to modifications in the terminology and language used in the industry of the target company, which may have an impact on the Material Adverse Effect (MAE) definition and carveouts in a legal agreement.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBTRFpp0FjlLGnwG1WxiYqv -->

