        <rdfs:label>Redeeming Shares in Company Merger or Sale</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Canje de acciones en fusiones o ventas de empresas</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Einlösen von Aktien bei Unternehmensfusionen oder -verkäufen</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Rachat d&apos;actions lors d&apos;une fusion ou d&apos;une vente d&apos;entreprise</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Redeeming Shares in Company Merger or Sale</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Redención de acciones en fusiones o ventas de empresas</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Resgate de ações em fusões ou vendas de empresas</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">גילוי עניינים במכירת חברה או במיזוג</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">कंपनी मर्जर या बिक्री में शेयर वापस लेना</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">企業合併または売却における株式の償還</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">在公司合并或出售中赎回股份</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of &quot;Redeeming Shares in Company Merger or Sale&quot; refers to the legal process of exchanging shares in a company for cash or other assets during a merger or sale, which may result in liability claims against the corporation or partnership.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBULYMym4JpJmgkW3Q4Exdd -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBULYMym4JpJmgkW3Q4Exdd">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8nREeU6lB0zs0dt9N339nm"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9aSzp9cEiBCzObnP92jYFX"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rx7CkM9fjahTS5lZtG21ZR"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Residence</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Residence refers to a specific place where an individual or entity lives or operates. It can include a personal residence where someone lives, or a business residence where a company operates its activities. This aspect is important for several legal analyses (e.g., personal jurisdiction, bankruptcy law, tax law). Residence refers to a person&apos;s fixed, permanent, and principal home, often with legal implications and the intention to remain for an extended period, in contrast to &quot;occupancy,&quot; which refers to the physical act of living in or using a property, which can be temporary or intermittent,</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBUPYY4wgW05EfNJ6kDq8mb -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBUPYY4wgW05EfNJ6kDq8mb">
