        <skos:altLabel>Villa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A House is a residential building designed to provide living space for individuals or families, typically featuring multiple rooms, including bedrooms, a kitchen, a bathroom, and common living areas. Houses vary in size, style, and structure, ranging from single-story bungalows to multi-story mansions.</skos:definition>
