        <rdfs:label>Securities Lending Agreement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Securities Lending Agreement allows the temporary transfer of securities, typically stocks or bonds, from an initial holder to another party in return for collateral, which could be cash or other securities. The agreement also outlines terms for the return of the lent securities.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


