        <rdfs:label>Employment Classification</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Worker Classification</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Worker Classification refers to the categorization of an employee&apos;s work status within an organization, often defined as full-time, part-time, or contractor. These classifications dictate the terms of employment, including benefits eligibility, tax implications, and legal obligations between the employer and employee.</skos:definition>
