        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">עו&quot;ד חשבונאות</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">बिलिंग वकील</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">請求書作成弁護士</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">计费律师</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A billing attorney is the lawyer responsible for keeping track of billable hours and expenses associated with a legal matter, and for preparing and issuing invoices to clients. This attorney ensures that the client is accurately billed for legal services provided, and may also address any billing inquiries or disputes that may arise.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


