            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Fitness &amp; Exercise Market Segment</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Workout Market Segment</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The fitness &amp; exercise market segment refers to a division of the market that is specifically targeted towards consumers who are interested in physical fitness and exercise. This segment encompasses products, services, and marketing strategies that are designed to cater to the needs, preferences, and interests of individuals who seek to maintain or improve their physical health, fitness level, and overall well-being through various forms of exercise.</skos:definition>
        <skos:example>Home Fitness Equipment</skos:example>
        <skos:example>Wearable Fitness Trackers</skos:example>
        <skos:example>Yoga and Pilates Studios</skos:example>
        <skos:prefLabel>Health &amp; Fitness Market</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


