        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">监管征收索赔</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">規制による財産権侵害請求</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Regulatory Taking refers to a situation where a government regulation or law results in the taking of private property or its use, without providing just compensation to the owner.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


