        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">自発的に事件を却下する動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Dismiss the Case Voluntarily is a formal request made by the plaintiff or petitioner to end the case without prejudice, meaning that the plaintiff or petitioner can refile the case at a later time.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


