        <rdfs:label>New York Supreme Court - Franklin County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The New York Supreme Court - Franklin County is a court of general jurisdiction located in Franklin County, New York, which is a subdivision of the New York Supreme Court.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


