        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">略式判決申立書</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">缺席判决动议书</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Default Judgment is a formal request made to a court asking for a judgment in favor of the moving party when the opposing party has failed to take action or respond to the case.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


