        <rdfs:label>B.F.A. (Bachelor of Fine Arts)</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>B.F.A.</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A B.F.A. (Bachelor of Fine Arts) is a four-year undergraduate degree focused on artistic disciplines such as visual arts, performing arts, or design. It represents proficiency in creative and artistic endeavors.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Bachelor of Fine Arts</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBdX70w6s28eu8tEayKral -->

