        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">租金比例分配条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A proration of rent clause is a provision in a contract that specifies how rent will be divided and calculated when a tenant moves in or out of a property during a rental period.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


