        <skos:altLabel>Local Authority Representative</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Local Official</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Town Government Officer</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Local Governmental Representative is an elected or appointed official who serves in a governmental capacity at the municipal or community level. This individual is responsible for making decisions, implementing policies, and representing the interests of their constituents within a specific local jurisdiction, such as a city, town, county, or school district.</skos:definition>
