        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">開示請求</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Discovery Motions are requests made by parties in a legal case to obtain information or evidence from the opposing party, which may include motions to compel production of documents, depositions, or responses, as well as motions for protective orders or sanctions.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


