        <rdfs:label>Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court - Lehigh County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court in Lehigh County is a specific court within the Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court system that has jurisdiction over minor criminal offenses and civil cases.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


