        <skos:definition>Domestication Action refers to the legal process of making a foreign judgment enforceable in a jurisdiction different from where it was originally issued. This involves registering or recognizing the judgment in the new jurisdiction to allow for its enforcement, including collections.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Foreign Judgment Enforcement</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBg7sRYxsZKH1clvAIAQWhO -->

