        <rdfs:label>Employment Events</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Employment Events refer to specific milestones in an employee&apos;s work history with an organization, such as the date of hiring, date of termination, and date of re-hiring. These events are important for both administrative record-keeping and compliance with employment laws and regulations</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


