        <rdfs:label>Compliance Risk</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Risk in the way that an entity might comply (or potentially fail to comply) with applicable laws and/or regulations. This risk can arise from an organization&apos;s failure to adhere to internal policies, industry standards, or legal and regulatory requirements. Causes can include inadequate controls, lack of training, or noncompliance with ethical or governance standards, potentially leading to legal penalties, reputational damage, or loss of stakeholder trust, ultimately impacting the organization&apos;s overall performance and sustainability.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


