        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">अमीकस के रूप में फ़ाइल करने के लिए छूट के लिए मोशन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">アミクス・キュリアエとして提出するための許可申請</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">申请作为友情参与人提交文件的动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Leave to File as Amicus is a legal document filed by a non-party to a case, seeking permission from the court to submit a brief or argument in support of one of the parties.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


