        <skos:definition>DEPRECATED in favor of Proceeding Inactive</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>Inactive Status refers to the current condition or state of an entity, such as an account, membership, or license, indicating that it is not currently operational or in use. In legal and business contexts, an entity with inactive status is generally not engaged in its designated activities and may not be in compliance with certain requirements or obligations.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


