        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">遗产滥用原因</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">遺産濫用の理由</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Probate Reason of Abuse refers to a specific reason for filing a subsequent probate, which involves the abuse of power or mistreatment of an individual by the executor or administrator of an estate.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


