        <rdfs:label>Handicapped Space Violation</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>This violation happens when a vehicle is parked in a space designated for handicapped individuals without the proper permit or authorization. Such a violation often results in a substantial fine and possible towing of the offending vehicle.</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <skos:prefLabel>Handicapped Parking Violation Claim</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


