        <skos:altLabel>The Fifth</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The suffix &quot;V&quot; stands for &quot;Fifth&quot; and is used after a person&apos;s full name to indicate that they are the fifth generation in their family to bear that name. This convention helps to distinguish individuals in formal, legal, or financial documents.</skos:definition>
