        <rdfs:label>New York Supreme Court - Montgomery County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The New York Supreme Court - Montgomery County is a court of general jurisdiction located in Montgomery County, New York, with authority to hear and decide a wide range of legal disputes within its geographic jurisdiction.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


