        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">有限责任公司</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Société à responsabilité limitée (short SARL and variations thereof; lit. &quot;society with limited responsibility&quot;) is a form of private company that exists mainly in French-speaking countries, such as France, Luxembourg, Monaco, Algeria, Morocco, Tunisia, Madagascar, Lebanon, and Switzerland (where it is also designated by GmbH or Sagl).</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel>SARL</skos:hiddenLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


