        <rdfs:label>Repapering Management</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Repapering Management refers to the process of updating legal documents and agreements to comply with new regulations or changes in the law, and falls under the broader category of Legal Operations.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBq0bnUySG0oj3qhTwodDjN -->

