        <rdfs:comment>From LIST: Legal Issues Taxonomy — https://taxonomy.legal/</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Economic Development Service</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Economic development refers to the efforts and policies aimed at improving the economic well-being and quality of life in a community, often involving job creation, business growth, and improvements in infrastructure. Laws and regulations in this area can encompass a wide range of topics, including zoning, public funding, tax incentives, environmental assessments, and employment standards.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


