        <skos:altLabel>MAE</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Material Adverse Effect Definition - &quot;Constructive Knowledge - Role-based&quot; Language</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הגדרת פגיעה חומרית משמעותית - שפת &quot;ידע בונה - מבוססת תפקיד&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">सामग्री विपरीत प्रभाव परिभाषा - &quot;निर्माणात्मक ज्ञान - भूमिका आधारित&quot; भाषा</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">实质不利影响定义 - 建设性知识 - 基于角色的语言</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">重大な不利な影響の定義-建設的な知識-役割ベースの言語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Material Adverse Effect (MAE) is a legal term that refers to a negative change or event that has a significant impact on a party&apos;s ability to fulfill their obligations under a contract or agreement.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBtPtW4K2v5gMVDBHyOUyCf -->

