        <rdfs:label>Ducks</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Ducks are domesticated waterfowl belonging to the family Anatidae, commonly raised for their meat, eggs, and feathers. They are versatile birds that thrive in various environments, including wetlands and agricultural settings, and are valued for their high-quality meat and egg production.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


