        <skos:altLabel>Funeral Rites</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Mortuary Practices</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Funeral Practices are the various rituals, ceremonies, and customs performed to honor and remember a deceased person. These practices vary greatly across different cultures, religions, and legal systems, often reflecting the beliefs and traditions of the community.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Death Rites</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


