        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">関連動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>In certain court jurisdictions (e.g., N.D. Cal.), where a newly filed case relates to a previously filed case, a party may a motion to consider whether the case should be related. Example: N.D. Cal. Local Rule 3-12. https://www.docketalarm.com/cases/California_Northern_District_Court/5--20-cv-08570/Klein_et_al_v._Facebook_Inc/68/#q=%22motion+to+relate%22</skos:definition>
