        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">संपत्ति के प्रस्तावित उपयोग, बिक्री या किराए पर देने की सूचना</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">財産の提案された使用、販売、またはリースの通知</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">财产拟使用、出售或出租通知</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Notice of Proposed Use, Sale, or Lease of Property is a written communication that informs interested parties of the intention to use, sell, or lease a particular property, and is typically required by law to be provided in advance of any such action.</skos:definition>
