        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">检查权</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Right of Inspection is the legal entitlement of a shareholder or member of a corporation or partnership to examine and review the company&apos;s books, records, and other relevant documents to ensure transparency and accountability.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBx7ocbIu8JTeBLppS10hVk -->

