        <rdfs:label>City Councilperson</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Alderman</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Alderwoman</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Municipal Legislator</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Town Councilor</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A City Councilperson is an elected official who serves as a member of a city&apos;s legislative body, typically known as the city council. This individual is responsible for proposing, debating, and voting on local ordinances, policies, and budgets that govern the municipality and affect its residents.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>City Council Member</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


