        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">旁观者情感困扰</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Bystander Emotional Distress refers to the legal claim that a person who witnesses the harm caused to another person can also suffer emotional distress and can seek compensation for it, under the Infliction of Emotional Distress claim.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


