        <rdfs:label>Male Market Segment</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The male market segment refers to a division of the market that is specifically targeted towards male consumers. This segment encompasses products, services, and marketing strategies that are designed to cater to the needs, preferences, and interests of men, taking into account factors such as lifestyle, life stage, and purchasing behavior.</skos:definition>
        <skos:example>Men&apos;s Clothing Retailer</skos:example>
        <skos:example>Men&apos;s Health Product</skos:example>
        <skos:prefLabel>Men&apos;s Market Segment</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


