        <rdfs:label>Transition Services Agreement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Transition Services Agreement is an agreement between a seller and a buyer where the seller agrees to provide post-closure services (like IT, HR, or accounting) to ensure a smooth transition after a transaction, such as a merger or sale.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


