        <dc:source>From LIST: Legal Issues Taxonomy — https://taxonomy.legal/</dc:source>
        <rdfs:label>Familial Role</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Familial Role defines an individual&apos;s position or relationship within a family structure based on genetic ties, marriage, or legal definitions. Examples include roles such as parent, child, grandparent, sibling, or spouse, each carrying specific relational dynamics, responsibilities, and societal expectations.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


