        <rdfs:label>Medical Consent Form</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>A Medical Consent Form is a legal document signed by a patient or their legal guardian granting permission for medical treatment or procedures. The form usually outlines the specifics of the treatment and the associated risks.</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Therapeutic Permission Document</skos:altLabel>
