        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">房地产经纪人佣金的委托人/推广者恶意责任</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The liability of a principal or promoter for a real estate broker&apos;s commission due to bad faith, where the principal or promoter acted with dishonesty or deceit in the transaction, resulting in the broker not receiving the commission they were entitled to.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


