        <rdfs:label>Firm Data Science Personnel</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Firm data science personnel are professionals within a law firm or legal organization who specialize in analyzing and interpreting complex data to support decision-making, identify trends, and enhance legal services. They apply statistical methods, machine learning algorithms, and data visualization techniques to derive insights from various legal data sources, such as case law, contracts, and client information.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


