        <rdfs:label>DUPE Motion to Consolidate Case</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A &quot;DUPE Motion to Consolidate Case&quot; is a deprecated concept in legal knowledge management that refers to a motion filed by a party in a lawsuit to consolidate their case with another case that involves similar issues and parties.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


