        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Moción para Excluir Informe</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Motion pour exclure le rapport</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Motion to Exclude Report</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Petição para excluir o relatório</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעה לאפשור דווח</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">रिपोर्ट को निकालने के लिए याचिका</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">報告の除外申立て</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">排除报告动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Exclude Report is a legal request to prevent a specific report or evidence from being presented in court proceedings.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCC0YY2TKtXIaQCGej7bg9A -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCC0YY2TKtXIaQCGej7bg9A">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RKY2B2HNSx5K82dgVN6Qn7"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RN3mWlXZUAt07dYsu6tls2"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R76UTCrg8DDzlFkZCPjrdqe"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Registration for Skilled Workers and Specialty Occupations</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>H-1B Registration</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>In the United States, the H-1B registration refers to the online registration process implemented by U.S. Citizenship and Immigration Services (USCIS) for the H-1B visa lottery. Prior to submitting a complete H-1B petition, employers seeking to hire foreign workers in specialty occupations must first register electronically during the designated registration period. The registration process involves providing basic information about the employer and the intended H-1B beneficiary (employee). If selected in the lottery, the employer can then proceed to file the full H-1B petition. The registration system aims to streamline the H-1B application process and make it more efficient for both employers and USCIS</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


