        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">美国战略司令部</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>United States Strategic Command (USSTRATCOM), is one of ten unified commands in the United States Department of Defense. It is responsible for strategic deterrence, global strike, and operating the Defense Department&apos;s Global Information Grid.</skos:definition>
