        <rdfs:label>Florida Circuit Court - Hardee County - 10th Circuit Court</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Florida Circuit Court located in Hardee County within the 10th Circuit Court, responsible for administering legal proceedings within its jurisdiction.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


