            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Motion to Disqualify Judge on Due Process Grounds</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Antrag auf Ablehnung des Richters aus Gründen des rechtmäßigen Verfahrens</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Moción para descalificar al juez por motivos de debido proceso</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Moción para recusar al juez por motivos de debido proceso</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Motion pour disqualifier le juge pour des motifs de procédure régulière</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Motion to Disqualify Judge on Due Process Grounds</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Petição para desqualificar o juiz por motivos de devido processo legal</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעה לפסול את השופט על יסודות הצדק הנדרשים</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">दंड प्रक्रिया के आधार पर जज को अयोग्य ठहराने की मोशन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">基于正当程序的理由提出撤销法官的动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">適正手続きの理由に基づく裁判官の拒否申立</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Disqualify Judge on Due Process Grounds is a legal request to remove a judge from a case based on a violation of the defendant&apos;s right to a fair trial.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCJn3atbap7QaYJjysSsJ1P -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCJn3atbap7QaYJjysSsJ1P">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDeR0053Q1cPSk9hSjORcBT"/>
        <dc:identifier>AFS-ACCM</dc:identifier>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=721"/>
        <rdfs:label>Accommodation Industry</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Accommodation and Hospitality</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Accommodation and Hospitality Industry</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Industria de Alojamiento y Hospitalidad</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Industria de Hospedaje y Hospitalidad</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Industrie de l&apos;hébergement et de l&apos;hospitalité</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Indústria de Acomodação e Hospitalidade</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Unterkunfts- und Gastgewerbebranche</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תעשיית אירוח ואירופה</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">आवास और आतिथ्य उद्योग</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">住宿和餐饮行业</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">宿泊・ホスピタリティ産業</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Industries in the Accommodation subsector provide lodging or short-term accommodations for travelers, vacationers, and others.  There is a wide range of establishments in these industries.  Some provide lodging only, while others provide meals, laundry services, and recreational facilities, as well as lodging.  Lodging establishments are classified in this subsector even if the provision of complementary services generates more revenue.  The types of complementary services provided vary from establishment to establishment.

The subsector is organized into three groups: (1) traveler accommodation, (2) recreational accommodation, and (3) rooming and boarding houses, dormitories, and workers&apos; camps.  The Traveler Accommodation industry group includes establishments that primarily provide traditional types of lodging services.  This group includes hotels, motels, and bed-and-breakfast inns.  In addition to lodging, these establishments may provide a range of other services to their guests.  The RV (Recreational Vehicle) Parks and Recreational Camps industry group includes establishments that operate lodging facilities primarily designed to accommodate outdoor enthusiasts.  Included are travel trailer campsites, recreational vehicle parks, and outdoor adventure retreats.  The Rooming and Boarding Houses, Dormitories, and Workers&apos; Camps industry group includes establishments providing temporary or longer-term accommodations, that for the period of occupancy, may serve as a principal residence.  Board (i.e., meals) may be provided but is not essential.

Establishments that manage short-stay accommodation establishments (e.g., hotels and motels) on a contractual basis are classified in this subsector if they both manage the operation and provide the operating staff.  Such establishments are classified based on the type of facility managed and operated.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel>ACCM</skos:hiddenLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCJnPLsPjR3hyvnxdMnNOZ2 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCJnPLsPjR3hyvnxdMnNOZ2">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RC2fjcpsEbrVvVymvt4oASx"/>
        <rdfs:label>Breach of Contract for Failure of Consideration</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Breach of Contract for Failure of Consideration</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Incumplimiento de contrato por falta de contraprestación</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Incumplimiento de contrato por falta de contraprestación</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Quebra de contrato por falha na contraprestação</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Vertragsbruch wegen Nichterfüllung der Gegenleistung</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Violation de contrat pour défaut de contrepartie</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הפרת חוזה עקב כשל בתמורה</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">विचार की कमी के कारण अनुबंध उल्लंघन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">対価不履行による契約違反</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">未履行合同违约</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Breach of Contract for Failure of Consideration refers to a situation where one party fails to fulfill their contractual obligations due to a lack of consideration from the other party.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCJp5HZBIFCirHaWGT77AF0 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCJp5HZBIFCirHaWGT77AF0">
