        <rdfs:label>Missouri Circuit Court - Pemiscot County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Missouri Circuit Court - Pemiscot County: A court of law in the state of Missouri that has jurisdiction over legal matters within Pemiscot County.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


