            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Warrant Agreement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Warrant Agreement is a document that outlines the terms of a warrant, which is a derivative giving the holder the right, but not the obligation, to buy or sell an underlying asset at a specific price within a certain period. Warrant agreements detail the exercise price, expiration date, and other terms.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


