        <rdfs:label>Business Executive</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Executive</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A business executive is someone holding a senior management position within a company or organization, responsible for making strategic decisions and overseeing the implementation of the company&apos;s policies and objectives. Executives typically include roles such as Chief Executive Officer (CEO), Chief Information Officer (CIO), Senior Vice President (SVP), and Vice President (VP), among others.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


