        <rdfs:label>Missouri Circuit Court - Pettis County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Missouri Circuit Court in Pettis County is a specific court within the Missouri Circuit Court system that has jurisdiction over legal matters within Pettis County.</skos:definition>
