        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">卡舒比语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Kashubian (Language) is a written or spoken structured system of communication that consists of grammar and vocabulary, and is a subcategory of Language, specifically referring to the Kashubian language.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


