        <rdfs:label>Restricted Asset Ownership</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Restricted Ownership refers to the limitations and special conditions imposed on the ownership, transfer, or sale of assets (e.g., securities). These restrictions can include country-specific regulations, legal requirements, and contractual obligations that govern who can own or transfer these assets and under what conditions.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


