        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Definición de Impuestos Indemnizados/Otros Impuestos</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Indemnified Taxes/Other Taxes Definition</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הגדרת מסים מפוצלים/מסים אחרים</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">भरण-शुल्क अपवादित कर/अन्य कर परिभाषा</skos:altLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCOt1w05pKqV4V4gwFEKcfs -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCOt1w05pKqV4V4gwFEKcfs">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDfdmGR6iPi4k2t6ecIUBkP"/>
        <dc:identifier>RET-MVPD</dc:identifier>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=441"/>
        <rdfs:label>Motor Vehicle and Parts Dealers Industry</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Industria de Concesionarios de Vehículos y Piezas</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Industria de Distribuidores de Vehículos y Partes</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Industrie des concessionnaires de véhicules automobiles et de pièces détachées</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Indústria de revendedores de veículos automotores e peças</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Kfz- und Teilehändlerbranche</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Motor Vehicle and Parts Dealer Industry</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Motor Vehicle and Parts Dealers</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תעשיית סוחרי רכבים וחלקים</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">मोटर वाहन और पार्ट डीलर उद्योग</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">汽车及零部件经销商行业</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">自動車および部品販売業界</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Industries in the Motor Vehicle and Parts Dealers subsector retail motor vehicles and parts.  Establishments in this subsector often operate from a showroom and/or an open lot where the vehicles are on display.  The display of vehicles and the related parts require little by way of display equipment.  The personnel generally include both the sales and sales support staff familiar with the requirements for registering and financing a vehicle as well as a staff of parts experts and mechanics trained to provide repair and maintenance services for the vehicles.  Specific industries included in this subsector identify the type of vehicle being retailed.

Sales of capital or durable nonconsumer goods, such as medium- and heavy-duty trucks, are always included in wholesale trade.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel>MVPD</skos:hiddenLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCOve2Lrd0BfjKJD1geC9WJ -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCOve2Lrd0BfjKJD1geC9WJ">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9oz08cWJcI23x0nYU1h0it"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDe0RKU39BlhcyACJW30ZLc"/>
        <rdfs:label>Environmental Indemnification Clause</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Clause d&apos;indemnisation environnementale</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Cláusula de indemnización ambiental</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Cláusula de indemnización ambiental</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Cláusula de indenização ambiental</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Environmental Indemnification Clause</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Klausel zur Umweltindemnität</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">סעיף פיצויים סביבתיים</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">पर्यावरण भरण-पोषण शर्त</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">环境赔偿条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">環境補償条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Environmental Indemnification Clause is a provision in a contract that requires one party to compensate the other for any losses or damages resulting from environmental contamination or pollution caused by the first party&apos;s actions.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCOztyLvDeuEOO20jLp0Gi3 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCOztyLvDeuEOO20jLp0Gi3">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8zwKGkogGKIKWSVWb1ItRL"/>
        <rdfs:label>Post-Trial Motions</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Anträge nach dem Prozess</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Mociones posteriores al juicio</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Mociones posteriores al juicio</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Motions postérieures au procès</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Post-Trial Motions</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Recursos pós-julgamento</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעות לאחר המשפט</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">पोस्ट-ट्रायल मोशन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">判決後の請求</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">审判后动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Post-Trial Motions are requests made by a party after a trial has concluded, asking the court to take a specific action, such as granting a new trial or amending the findings, based on the evidence presented during the trial.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCP0d1k1Zn9Z7wweXZB1rCw -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCP0d1k1Zn9Z7wweXZB1rCw">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R49sp0iRvML6Mzkr06Bimd"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9q0hyYnNxQC475BKXOxjbm"/>
        <rdfs:label>Insurer&apos;s Breach of Implied Covenant of Good Faith and Fair Dealing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Duty of Good Faith</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Incumplimiento por parte del asegurador del convenio implícito de buena fe y trato justo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Incumplimiento por parte del asegurador del convenio implícito de buena fe y trato justo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Insurer&apos;s Breach of Implied Covenant of Good Faith and Fair Dealing</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Verletzung der stillschweigenden Pflicht zur Treu und Glauben des Versicherers</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Violation de l&apos;obligation implicite de bonne foi et de loyauté de l&apos;assureur</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Violação da obrigação implícita de boa-fé e lealdade do segurador</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הפרת הבטחת האמון המשתלמת והטיפול הוגן של הביטוחן</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">बीमा कंपनी की विश्वसनीय नियम और न्यायपूर्ण व्यवहार के उल्लंघन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">保险人违反善意和公平原则</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">保険会社の善意と公正な取引の違反</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Insurer&apos;s Breach of Implied Covenant of Good Faith and Fair Dealing refers to a violation by an insurance company of the obligation to act in good faith and deal fairly with its policyholders, which is implied in every insurance contract.</skos:definition>
        <skos:inScheme>UK</skos:inScheme>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCP4jMji1Crm7iRVVtsLgwq -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCP4jMji1Crm7iRVVtsLgwq">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RD3LBDAXqjURNXVGHaWXf7s"/>
        <rdfs:label>Patent Reexamination Process</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Patent Reassessment</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Patent Reevaluation</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Patent Reexamination</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Patent Review</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Patent Reexamination Process allows the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office (USPTO) to re-evaluate the validity of an existing patent based on new evidence or prior art not considered during the original examination. This process can be requested by the patent owner or a third party and aims to confirm the patent&apos;s claims or cancel them if they are found to be invalid.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


