        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">ジャワ語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">爪哇语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Javanese (Language) refers to the written or spoken structured system of communication that consists of grammar and vocabulary specific to the Javanese language, which is a member of the Austronesian language family and primarily spoken on the island of Java in Indonesia.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


