        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">处置通知条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Notice of Disposition Clause is a provision in a legal document that specifies how property or assets will be distributed or disposed of upon a certain event, such as death or termination of a contract.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


