        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">陈述和保证的分类</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>&quot;Classifications of Representations and Warranties&quot; refer to the categorization of assertions made by one party to another in a contractual agreement regarding the state of affairs, facts, or promises.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


