        <skos:definition>Birth Details refer to specific information about an individual&apos;s birth, commonly including Date of Birth, Country of Birth, and City of Birth. These details are often required in legal, medical, and governmental contexts for identification, verification of nationality, and eligibility for certain rights or benefits.</skos:definition>
