        <rdfs:label>Texas Court of Appeals - 10th</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Texas Court of Appeals - 10th is a specific intermediate appellate court in Texas that hears appeals from lower courts within its jurisdiction.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


