        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">判決の更新申請</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Application for Renewal of Judgment is a legal document filed in bankruptcy proceedings seeking to extend the time period for collecting a debt that has already been reduced to a judgment.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


