        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">干扰未来关系</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">見込み取引妨害</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Interference with Prospective Relations refers to the intentional and unjustified interference with a party&apos;s potential or anticipated business relationships or economic advantages, causing harm or loss to that party.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCXo6eQMlbZx9milrSaYo1v -->

