            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Educational Quality Objective</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Educational Quality Objective refers to the goal of ensuring a high standard of education for all students, irrespective of their socio-economic or cultural backgrounds. This objective emphasizes the delivery of comprehensive, well-rounded, and effective educational experiences, utilizing optimal resources, curriculum standards, teaching methodologies, and continuous assessment to promote student success and lifelong learning.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


