        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">已提供服务的支付条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">提供されたサービスの支払い条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Payment for Services Rendered Clause is a provision in a contract that outlines the terms and conditions for compensating a party for services provided.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCXvE9qNpT0Q1Ftb6C1B554 -->

