        <skos:definition>A criminal record is an official compilation of an individual&apos;s past arrests, charges, convictions, and other interactions with the criminal justice system. This record can have implications for employment, housing, and other opportunities, as many entities conduct background checks. In some jurisdictions, certain convictions can be expunged or sealed, removing them from public view.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


