        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">अच्छी और कुशल सेवाओं की निहित वारंटी का उल्लंघन - होम कंस्ट्रक्शन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">暗黙の保証違反 - 住宅建設における善良かつ熟練したサービス</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">违反默示的良好和工匠服务保证 - 住宅建筑</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Breach of Implied Warranty of Good &amp; Workmanlike Services in Home Construction refers to a violation of the implied promise that a contractor will provide services that meet industry standards and are of a quality that a reasonable person would expect in the construction of a home.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


