        <rdfs:label>Indiana Circuit Court</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Indiana Circuit Court is a court of general jurisdiction in the state of Indiana that hears civil and criminal cases within its geographical jurisdiction.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


