        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">禁止债务人动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Bar Debtor is a legal request made in a bankruptcy case to prevent the debtor from taking certain actions or receiving certain benefits.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCiCzsuHmzW17PrVQ6qGFY6 -->

