        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">心理療法士の過失</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Negligent or wrongful conduct by a licensed psychotherapist that causes harm or injury to a patient, resulting in a legal claim for damages.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


