        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">適用法律条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Governing Law Clause is a provision in a contract that specifies the jurisdiction whose laws will govern the interpretation and enforcement of the contract.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


