        <skos:altLabel>Right of Use</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Right of Property Use refers to the civil law concept of legal entitlement to utilize a property for certain activities as permitted by law or contract. This can include residential, commercial, or agricultural uses, and may be subject to zoning laws, covenants, and other legal restrictions</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


