        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">公司成立后的债务的创始人/发起人责任</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">設立後の債務に対する創業者/プロモーターの責任</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Principal/Promoter Liability for Post-Incorporation Debt: The legal responsibility of an individual or entity who acted as a promoter or principal in the incorporation of a company, for any debts incurred by the company after its incorporation.</skos:definition>
