        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">迅速な裁判の申立て</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Expedite Trial is a legal request made by a party in a case to speed up the trial process and obtain a quicker resolution.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCkhuNYIeabQ2ct4FvjFsp -->

