        <skos:definition>&quot;Used to indicate whether there are (&quot;&quot;Y&quot;&quot;) or are not (&quot;&quot;N&quot;&quot;) any fee or children of fee line items, or expense or children of expense line items, associated with this invoice.
&quot;</skos:definition>
