        <skos:altLabel>Arable Land</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Cultivation Land</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Crop Farmland refers to specific parcels of agricultural land designated for the cultivation of crops. The relevant legal issues often revolve around land use rights, agricultural contracts, crop patents, and environmental regulations.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


