        <rdfs:label>Van (Motor Vehicle)</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A van is a motor vehicle typically larger than a car, designed to transport passengers or cargo. Vans come in various sizes and configurations and are commonly used for transporting goods, people, or both, depending on their purpose and design.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


