        <rdfs:label>Texas Court of Appeals - 1st</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Texas Court of Appeals - 1st is a specific intermediate appellate court in Texas that hears appeals from trial courts in its jurisdiction.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


