        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">一般保证条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A General Warranty Clause is a provision in a contract that guarantees the quality and condition of the goods or services being provided, without specifying any particular defects or issues that may arise.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


