        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">प्रमाणित या कैशियर का चेक गलत तरीके से अस्वीकृत किया गया</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">認定済みまたは出納手形の不当な不渡り</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">错误拒付的认证或出纳支票</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Certified or Cashier&apos;s Check Wrongfully Dishonored refers to a situation where a bank refuses to honor a certified or cashier&apos;s check despite having sufficient funds, resulting in damages to the payee.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


