        <rdfs:label>Originality</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Creative</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Originality in copyright law requires that a work must be independently created and possess a minimum degree of creativity. This concept ensures that copyright protection is granted only to works that reflect the author&apos;s own intellectual effort and not mere copies or trivial variations of existing works.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


