        <skos:altLabel>Long-Term Skin Conditions</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Persistent Skin Disorders</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Chronic conditions of the skin or mucous membranes are long-lasting disorders that affect the skin or mucous membranes, causing persistent symptoms that impact daily functioning. These conditions can lead to significant discomfort, functional limitations, and may require ongoing medical management.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Chronic Conditions of the Skin or Mucous Membranes</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


