        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">विवाद रहित प्रतिनिधित्व</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">无冲突表示</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">競合なし表現</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A No-Conflict Representation is a statement made by a party in a legal matter that they have not entered into any agreements or relationships or have any organizational or government-mandated provisions or requirements that would conflict with the transaction at hand.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpU9aLVS5J4S24D8DojlU1 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpU9aLVS5J4S24D8DojlU1">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDOvAHsvY8TKJ1O1orXPM9o"/>
        <rdfs:label>Rapanui</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Rapanui</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Rapanui</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Rapanui</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">ラパヌイ語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">拉帕努伊语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Rapanui (Language) is a structured system of communication spoken on Easter Island, characterized by its unique grammar and vocabulary.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpWbLzy6VaAxkqLgsTKfcj -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpWbLzy6VaAxkqLgsTKfcj">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9H0HvybK6M3RpFebn0SDLu"/>
        <rdfs:label>World Trade Organization</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Global Trade Regulator</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The World Trade Organization (WTO) is an international organization that regulates global trade by providing a framework for negotiating trade agreements and a dispute resolution process aimed at enforcing participants&apos; adherence to WTO agreements. Established in 1995, the WTO aims to ensure that trade flows as smoothly, predictably, and freely as possible.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>WTO</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpagOV2VhFbRq45EpShPt8 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpagOV2VhFbRq45EpShPt8">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDOvAHsvY8TKJ1O1orXPM9o"/>
        <rdfs:label>Sidamo</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Sidamo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Sidamo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Sidamo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">シダモ</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">锡达莫</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Sidamo is a language spoken in Ethiopia and is a subcategory of the Language class in the ontology.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpfHqAg9WjVsZ26p1Movwl -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpfHqAg9WjVsZ26p1Movwl">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7sHH7RvjZ6aZS7ZExDpYmR"/>
        <rdfs:label>Ancestry</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Abstammung</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Ascendance</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Ascendência</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">祖先</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">血统</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Ancestry refers to the lineage or descent of an individual, tracing their familial roots and heritage through previous generations. In legal contexts, ancestry can relate to employment claims regarding alleged discrimination or harassment in the workplace based on their ancestry. This could include allegations that an individual has been treated unfairly or unequally based on their actual or perceived ancestral background, which can include their ethnic, national, or cultural origins. These claims typically arise in the context of employment, housing, or public services, and are prohibited under various anti-discrimination laws.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpfcOgyjYTJ1T4nWF9DzC9 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpfcOgyjYTJ1T4nWF9DzC9">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RVYssk48JQ3Ouv98v8U1Ai"/>
        <rdfs:label>Business Associate Agreement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>BAA</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Business Associate Agreement (BAA) is a legally binding document required under the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA). It ensures that business associates (entities or individuals that perform certain functions or activities involving the use or disclosure of protected health information on behalf of a covered entity) will uphold the same standards of privacy and security as the covered entity itself.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpgZ2FzF6vHyeapUTLstks -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpgZ2FzF6vHyeapUTLstks">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8alUnZrt8GVEzHYhh1KTva"/>
        <rdfs:label>Intentional or Malicious Harm to Another</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Dano intencional ou malicioso a outra pessoa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Daño intencional o malicioso a otra persona</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Daño intencional o malicioso a otra persona</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Dommage intentionnel ou malveillant à autrui</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Intentional or Malicious Harm to Another</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Vorsätzliche oder bösartige Schädigung eines anderen</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">פגיעה מתוכננת או זדונית באדם אחר</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">दूसरों को जानबूझकर या इच्छापूर्वक हानि पहुंचाना</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">他者への意図的または悪意のある害</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">故意或恶意伤害他人</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Intentional or Malicious Harm to Another refers to a legal claim for damages resulting from a deliberate and harmful act committed by one person against another.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpk7MQaCVMmCF57e1nm8PJ -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpk7MQaCVMmCF57e1nm8PJ">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDe0RKU39BlhcyACJW30ZLc"/>
        <rdfs:label>Agreement Null and Void Clause</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Agreement Null and Void Clause</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Clause de nullité d&apos;accord</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Cláusula de Nulidade de Acordo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Cláusula de nulidad y anulación del acuerdo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Cláusula de nulidad y anulación del acuerdo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Klausel zur Nichtigkeitserklärung von Vereinbarungen</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">סעיף פסולת הסכם ובטלויות</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">समझौता निरस्त और अमान्य धारा</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">协议无效条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">協定の無効条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An agreement null and void clause is a provision in a contract that declares the entire agreement to be invalid and unenforceable if a specific condition or event occurs, such as a breach of contract or illegality of the agreement.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpl1tMWPbEplg0P6GxQaLs -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCpl1tMWPbEplg0P6GxQaLs">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R3OI7nrib1LEPtUfn5G5CH"/>
        <rdfs:label>General Bequest</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>General Testamentary Gift</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A General Bequest is a provision in a will or trust that designates a fixed amount of money or quantity of assets to a beneficiary without specifying the exact source from which these assets should be drawn. It ensures the beneficiary receives the specified value or amount from the overall estate.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


