        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">要求订购更完整的记录</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Order More Complete Transcript is a request made by a party in a legal case to obtain a more detailed or comprehensive transcript of a previous court proceeding.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


