        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">非自愿解雇</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Involuntary Dismissal refers to the termination of a legal case by a judge without the plaintiff&apos;s consent, usually due to a procedural error or failure to comply with court orders.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


