        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">文書レビューの実践</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Review of Documents Practice refers to the legal work performed by a Legal Services Provider in the course of a legal matter, specifically involving the examination and analysis of documents collected and produced during the case, and may include the identification of relevant information and potential evidence.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


