        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">刑事虚假监禁</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Criminal False Imprisonment refers to the intentional and unlawful confinement or restraint of an individual against their will, without legal justification or authority, and with the knowledge that the confinement is unlawful.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCrVPCBH6CAlY5QotfilJKY -->

