        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">助産師の過失</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Negligent actions or omissions by a midwife during the provision of care to a mother and/or baby, resulting in harm or injury, and giving rise to a legal claim for compensation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCt3KWyx6hFyRJ3Qz6Vm2UG -->

