        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">mongol</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">モンゴル語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">蒙古语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Mongolian (Language) refers to the written or spoken structured system of communication that consists of grammar and vocabulary specific to the Mongolian language.</skos:definition>
