        <rdfs:label>Insurance Document</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>An Insurance Document is a formal written record that encompasses all types of materials related to the underwriting, administration, and execution of insurance policies. Examples include insurance forms, policies, and reinsurance agreements.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


