        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-us">C-1 Visa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A transit visa is a short-term visa that allows travelers to pass through a foreign country en route to another destination. This type of visa is generally valid for a very limited period, often 24 to 72 hours, and does not permit the holder to engage in activities like tourism or business within the transit country.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


