        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">律师费申请书</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Attorney Fees is a request made by a party in a legal case to recover the costs of their attorney&apos;s services, which may include fees, interest, and other expenses incurred during the proceedings.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


