        <rdfs:label>Speeding Ticket</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A speeding ticket is a written notice issued by a law enforcement officer to a driver who is alleged to have exceeded the posted speed limit. The ticket serves as a formal accusation of the speeding violation and typically includes information about the offense, the fine amount, and the steps the driver must take to resolve the matter.</skos:definition>
