        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">刑事因果関係</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Criminal Causation refers to the causal relationship between the defendant&apos;s actions and the resulting harm or injury, which is an essential element of a criminal claim.</skos:definition>
