        <rdfs:label>Monthly Recurring Revenue</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>MRR</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR) is a financial metric commonly used by subscription-based businesses to measure the total amount of revenue generated each month from recurring subscriptions. It does not include one-time payments or variable fees and is often used to assess business stability and growth potential.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


