        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">控訴状</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A writ appeal is a legal action taken by a party who is dissatisfied with a lower court&apos;s decision, requesting a higher court to review and potentially overturn the decision.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


