        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">担保物の管理</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of &quot;Caring for Collateral or Security&quot; refers to the legal responsibility of an agent to properly maintain and protect assets that have been pledged as security for a loan or other obligation.</skos:definition>
