        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">设定负担权条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Right to Encumber Clause is a provision in a contract that grants the right to create a lien or mortgage on the subject property as security for a debt or obligation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


