        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">累積権利条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Cumulative Rights Clause is a provision in a contract that allows a party to exercise all of their rights and remedies under the contract, in addition to any other rights and remedies available under the law.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


