        <rdfs:label>Muscular Dystrophy</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Muscle Degeneration Disorder</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Muscular Dystrophy (MD) is a group of genetic disorders characterized by progressive weakness and degeneration of the skeletal muscles that control movement. These disorders vary in severity, age of onset, and specific muscles affected, but they generally lead to a gradual loss of muscle function and mobility.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Muscular Degenerative Disorder</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


