        <rdfs:label>Firm Business Development Personnel</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Firm Business Development Personnel are professionals within a law firm or legal organization who focus on identifying and pursuing new business opportunities, expanding client relationships, and enhancing the firm&apos;s market position. They strategize and implement initiatives to attract new clients, retain existing ones, and increase the firm&apos;s revenue and growth potential.</skos:definition>
