        <rdfs:label>Travel Document Expiration Date</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Travel Document Expiration Date is the date on which a travel document like a passport or visa ceases to be valid. After this date, the document can no longer be used for international travel or for identification purposes as intended, and renewal or replacement is typically required</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


