        <rdfs:label>Prisoner Trust Fund Account Statement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Declaración de la cuenta del Fondo Fiduciario de Prisioneros</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Estado de cuenta del Fondo Fiduciario de Prisioneros</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Extrato da conta do Fundo de Confiança do Prisioneiro</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Kontoauszug des Gefangenen-Vertrauensfonds</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Prisoner Trust Fund Account Statement</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Relevé de compte du fonds de confiance des détenus</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הצהרת חשבון קרן האמון לכלאים</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">कैदी विश्वास निधि खाता विवरण</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">受刑者信託基金口座明細書</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">囚犯信托基金账户报表</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Prisoner Trust Fund Account Statement is a financial record of an inmate&apos;s account that holds money earned or received while incarcerated, used for purchasing items from the prison commissary or for other approved expenses.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFZ0a18F6aSNTJygcEr1je -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFZ0a18F6aSNTJygcEr1je">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCEWWtS3nM8GE8R4en1abRz"/>
        <rdfs:label>Arkansas Circuit Court - Lonoke Cty.</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The Arkansas Circuit Court - Lonoke Cty. is a specific court within the Arkansas Circuit Court system that has jurisdiction over legal matters within Lonoke County, Arkansas.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFaLEA8xsVvAShHpCmlFnO -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFaLEA8xsVvAShHpCmlFnO">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDe0RKU39BlhcyACJW30ZLc"/>
        <rdfs:label>Exculpatory Clause</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Clause d&apos;exonération de responsabilité</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Cláusula de exclusão de responsabilidade</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Cláusula exculpatoria</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Cláusula exculpatoria</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Exculpatory Clause</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Freistellungsklausel</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">סעיף פטור</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">अपराध से बचाने वाली शर्त</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">免責条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">免责条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An exculpatory clause is a type of contractual clause that releases one party from liability for certain actions or events, typically used in situations where one party is assuming a risk.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFd7fIt2iST6CSAzHKiMqN -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFd7fIt2iST6CSAzHKiMqN">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RB4GQZ26zq1PJ9m6vGUuoiy"/>
        <rdfs:label>Health Care Directive</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Directiva de atención médica</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Directiva de atención médica</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Directive anticipée de soins</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Diretiva antecipada de vontade</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Health Care Directive</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Healthcare Directive</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Patientenverfügung</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הוראות טיפול ברפואה</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">स्वास्थ्य देखभाल निर्देशिका</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">医疗保健指令</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">医療指示書</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Health Care Directive is a legal document that outlines an individual&apos;s wishes regarding medical treatment and end-of-life care in the event they become unable to make decisions for themselves.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFg3sCAGTiKXmwjQQ6mmuW -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFg3sCAGTiKXmwjQQ6mmuW">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBKpy2Nyht27CqaMOeeTx1N"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8a69mb9gzRyUSQsZdwSiA8"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Mortgagee Failing to Cancel Redeemed Mortgage</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Acreedor hipotecario que no cancela la hipoteca redimida</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Acreedor hipotecario que no cancela la hipoteca redimida</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Credor hipotecário que não cancela hipoteca resgatada</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Créancier hypothécaire ne parvenant pas à annuler une hypothèque rachetée</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Hypothekengläubiger versäumt es, eine eingelöste Hypothek zu stornieren</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Mortgagee Failing to Cancel Redeemed Mortgage</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">מלווה משכנתא שלא מבטל משכנתא שגורמת לפיצוי</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">अदालत द्वारा रद्द की गई मोटीज को रद्द न करने वाला ऋणदाता</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">償還された抵当権をキャンセルしない抵当権者</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">抵押权人未能取消已赎回的抵押贷款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>When a mortgagee fails to cancel a redeemed mortgage, it refers to the legal concept where a lender fails to release a borrower&apos;s property from the mortgage lien after the loan has been fully paid off, which can result in legal claims by the borrower against the lender.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFgKHH89MV9zwwkinVZtzk -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFgKHH89MV9zwwkinVZtzk">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7MGQ9xUx0PxGLp5yxprdpZ"/>
        <rdfs:label>11th Amendment Claim</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">11. Änderungsantrag</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">11th Amendment Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">11वीं संशोधन दावा</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Eleventh Amendment Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Reclamación de la 11ª Enmienda</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Reclamo de la 11ª Enmienda</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Reivindicação da 11ª Emenda</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Réclamation de 11ème amendement</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעת התיקון ה-11</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">第11修正案請求</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">第十一修正案索赔</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Eleventh Amendment claim is a legal argument asserting that a lawsuit against a state government or its agencies violates the Eleventh Amendment of the United States Constitution, which provides states with sovereign immunity from certain types of lawsuits in federal courts. These claims typically involve disputes over whether a state has consented to be sued or if there are specific exceptions that permit the lawsuit to proceed despite the Eleventh Amendment&apos;s protections.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


