        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">地域固有の利用のために予約されています</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Reserved for local use (Language): A term or label that is specific to a particular jurisdiction or organization and is not commonly used outside of that context, within the framework of language as a system of communication.</skos:definition>
