        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Interferência intencional em uma relação comercial prospectiva</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Vorsätzliche Beeinträchtigung einer Geschäftsbeziehung in Aussicht</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הפרעה בכוונה בקשר עסקי צפוי</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">प्रत्याशित व्यापार संबंध में जानबूझकर हस्तक्षेप</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">故意干涉预期商业关系</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">見込み顧客関係への意図的な干渉</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Intentional Interference with Prospective Business Relationship: A tort where a third party intentionally disrupts a business relationship that is likely to occur, causing economic harm to the plaintiff.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


