        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">财产移交动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Turnover of Property is a legal request made in a bankruptcy case, asking the court to order the transfer of specific property from the debtor to the trustee or creditor.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


