        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">因疏忽/遗弃而产生的遗嘱认证</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">怠慢/放棄による遺言執行手続き</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Probate due to Neglect/Abandonment refers to the legal process of distributing the assets of a deceased person who died without a will or heirs due to neglect or abandonment.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDMDwRdvGV1SmoM2o59K16g -->

