        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">施設利用条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Use of Premises Clause is a provision in a contract that outlines the permitted use of a specific property or space by the tenant or lessee.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


