            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Breathalyzer Test</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>BAC Test</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <skos:definition>A Breathalyzer test is a procedure that measures the concentration of alcohol in an individual&apos;s breath to determine their blood alcohol content (BAC). This test is commonly used by law enforcement agencies to assess if a driver is operating a vehicle under the influence of alcohol.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDNC62XHr3WDD7XO7B5HgGK -->

