        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">收购法规代表</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">買収法規代表</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A representation within a legal agreement that specifically pertains to the statutes and regulations related to the acquisition of a company.</skos:definition>
