        <rdfs:label>Counterfeit Identification Management</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Counterfeit Identification Management refers to the process of managing and preventing the production and distribution of fake identification documents, such as passports or driver&apos;s licenses, in order to protect intellectual property rights.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


