        <skos:altLabel>Interment</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Sepulture</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Burial is the process of placing a deceased person&apos;s body into the ground, typically accompanied by a funeral ceremony. It involves legal and cultural practices that vary widely across different societies and legal systems.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


