        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">訴状の修正申立</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Amend Complaint is a formal request made to a court to modify or change the allegations or claims made in a legal complaint.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


