        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">債務者返済計画</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Debtor Repayment Plan is a legal document that outlines a debtor&apos;s proposed plan to repay their debts to creditors, typically filed as part of a bankruptcy or restructuring proceeding.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


