        <skos:altLabel>State&apos;s Attorney</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A prosecutor is a legal professional responsible for representing the government in criminal cases by presenting evidence, building a case against the defendant, and seeking their conviction. Prosecutors also have a duty to ensure that justice is served and that defendants&apos; rights are upheld throughout the legal process.</skos:definition>
