        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">美国第9章破产</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Chapter 9 bankruptcy is a bankruptcy for municipalities &apos; cities, towns, counties and school districts, for example. Municipalities that file chapter 9 earn protection from creditors while they develop a plan for adjusting their debts.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel>USCHAP9</skos:hiddenLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


