        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">安德斯备忘录</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Anders Brief is a type of appellate brief filed by court-appointed counsel when they believe there are no non-frivolous issues to raise on appeal and seek to withdraw from representation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


