        <skos:definition>An act of a fellow employee that falls outside the scope of their job duties and is not related to the employer&apos;s business or interests, which may not be compensable under industrial injury claims.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDe9T6OMBcR00gwdQpFMG2S -->

