            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Visa for Diplomats and Foreign Government Officials</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>A-1 Visa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A visa for diplomats and foreign government officials is a specialized type of visa that allows individuals representing their home country&apos;s government to enter another country for official duties. These visas often come with certain privileges and immunities, as outlined by international law, to enable the holders to perform their roles effectively without legal hindrance.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDeHRgHYGz10XjAP70xATcX -->

