        <rdfs:label>New York Supreme Court - St. Lawrence County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The New York Supreme Court - St. Lawrence County is a court of general jurisdiction located in St. Lawrence County, New York, with authority to hear and decide legal disputes within its geographical jurisdiction.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDfZqM7f4PqixahPhKnCFGB -->

