        <skos:definition>The Finno-Ugrian languages are a group of languages that belong to the Language class and include Finnish, Estonian, and Hungarian, among others.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDftFxuGBK7sBFFDQDKSbmw -->

