            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Government Representative</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Government Representative refers to any individual who acts on behalf of a governmental body, whether they are an elected official, an appointed official, or a regular employee. The term encompasses a wide range of roles, from high-ranking government officials who make policy decisions to government employees who carry out administrative tasks, all serving the interests of the state or public they represent.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


