        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">進行中の嵐</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A &quot;Storm in Progress&quot; is a legal concept within the context of civil defenses and litigation, referring to a situation where a legal matter is currently ongoing and actively being pursued.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


