        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">反対尋問における観察のための動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Observation on Cross-Examination is a formal request made by a party in a trial court to allow them to observe the opposing party&apos;s cross-examination of a witness.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


