        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">原因を示す命令の動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for Order to Show Cause is a legal request made in a bankruptcy case asking the court to require a party to appear and explain why they should not be held in contempt for failing to comply with a court order or other legal obligation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


