        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">署名後に発生する介入イベント</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An intervening event that occurs after the signing of a legal agreement, which may affect the execution or performance of the agreement.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


