        <skos:altLabel>Chartered Financial Analyst</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The suffix &quot;C.F.A.&quot; stands for &quot;Chartered Financial Analyst&quot; and is used after a person&apos;s name to indicate that they have passed a series of exams and met other requirements set forth by the CFA Institute. This designation signifies the individual&apos;s expertise in investment management and financial analysis, and it is commonly used in finance, investment, and academic settings</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>C.F.A.</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


