        <rdfs:label>Mayor</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Mayor is the highest-ranking official in a municipal government, typically elected by the public or appointed by a city council. This individual serves as the chief executive officer of a city or town, responsible for overseeing local government operations, implementing policies, and representing the municipality in various capacities.</skos:definition>
