    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDr2w9AvQVNGuLJy9BotftQ -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDr2w9AvQVNGuLJy9BotftQ">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDF3VrmH1eapfkrSQstevLs"/>
        <dc:source rdf:resource="https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/13.00-NeoplasticDiseases-Malignant-Adult.htm#13_11"/>
        <rdfs:label>Nervous System Cancer</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Nervous system cancer encompasses malignant tumors originating in the central nervous system (CNS), which includes the brain and spinal cord, as well as primary cancers of the peripheral nerves or spinal roots. This category includes high-grade tumors such as glioblastoma multiforme, ependymoblastoma, diffuse intrinsic brain stem gliomas, and other aggressive malignancies that may be primary, metastatic, progressive, or recurrent following initial anticancer therapy.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDr6DXAcukDYZgOiiRN8qtf -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDr6DXAcukDYZgOiiRN8qtf">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7MGQ9xUx0PxGLp5yxprdpZ"/>
        <rdfs:label>14th Amendment Claim</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">14th Amendment Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">14वीं संशोधन दावा</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Anspruch auf den 14. Zusatzartikel</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Fourteenth Amendment Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Reclamo de la Decimocuarta Enmienda</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Reclamo de la Decimocuarta Enmienda</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Reivindicação da 14ª Emenda</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Réclamation fondée sur le 14ème amendement</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעת התיקון הארבע-עשרה</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">第14修正案索赔</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">第14改正請求</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Fourteenth Amendment claims are legal actions initiated by an individual alleging that their rights under the Fourteenth Amendment of the United States Constitution have been violated by the government or a government actor. The Fourteenth Amendment guarantees equal protection under the law and due process of law to all persons, and applies to actions taken by state and local governments. Fourteenth Amendment claims may arise in various contexts, such as when an individual is discriminated against on the basis of race, gender, national origin, or other protected categories, when an individual is deprived of their liberty or property without due process of law, or when an individual is denied equal protection of the law.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


