        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">開示強制執行請求</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Compel Discovery is a legal request made by one party to another party in a lawsuit, asking the court to order the other party to provide information or evidence that has not been previously disclosed or produced.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


