            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Debtor&apos;s Election of Subchapter V</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>A Debtor&apos;s Election of Subchapter V is a legal choice made by a debtor to proceed under Subchapter V of Chapter 11 in the U.S. Bankruptcy Code, which is designed specifically for small business debtors. This election allows for a more streamlined and less costly reorganization process, providing small business debtors with mechanisms to facilitate quicker and easier debt restructuring.</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


