        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">瓦格纳规则</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The Wagoner Rule is a legal defense in civil litigation that prevents a trustee from suing third-party professionals for damages caused by the trustee&apos;s own misconduct.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


