        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">港务局疏忽</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">港湾局の過失</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Negligent actions or omissions by a port authority, which may result in harm or damage to individuals or property within the scope of admiralty and maritime claims.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


