        <rdfs:label>ODR - No Facilitation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Online Dispute Resolution (ODR) Forum with no facilitation refers to a platform or forum that provides a mechanism for resolving disputes between parties online without the involvement of a third-party mediator or facilitator.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


