        <rdfs:label>South Dakota Supreme Court</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The South Dakota Supreme Court is the highest court in the state of South Dakota, responsible for hearing appeals and making final decisions on legal disputes within the state court system.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


