        <skos:definition>The thinking, strategizing, and planning for a case that is not included under other trademark task codes below. Includes discussions, writing, and meetings on case strategy. Also includes initial legal research for case assessment purposes and legal research for developing a basic case strategy. Most legal research and/or other activity will be under the primary task for which the research is conducted, such as research for a response to an office action under TR430 and TR630 respectively.</skos:definition>
