        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">服务条款代理机构</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Agency for Service Clause is a provision in a contract that designates a specific party as an agent to perform a particular service on behalf of another party.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


