        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">薬物関連器具の所持</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The possession of drug paraphernalia refers to the act of having equipment, materials, or products that are intended for use in the consumption, preparation, or storage of illegal drugs, and is classified as a criminal misdemeanor offense.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


