        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">契約検討条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Contract Consideration Clause is a specific provision within a contract that outlines the exchange of something of value between parties, which is necessary for the contract to be legally binding.</skos:definition>
