        <rdfs:label>UK Social Security Administration</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The UK Social Security Administration is the governmental body responsible for administering social security benefits, including pensions, unemployment benefits, and disability allowances, within the United Kingdom. It ensures the efficient distribution of benefits and manages the policies and regulations governing social security programs.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/REuZBD25lQC59CdA7Zp3KN -->

