        <rdfs:label>Short Form</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Short Form is a condensed version of a longer document, capturing the essential terms and conditions without the extensive detail. It is used in various legal contexts, such as contracts, agreements, and reports, to provide a succinct overview of the main points.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


