        <skos:altLabel>Revenge Pornography Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Unauthorized Distribution of Intimate Images Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A revenge porn claim is a legal assertion that an individual&apos;s private, sexually explicit images or videos have been distributed without their consent, typically as an act of revenge or harassment. This claim seeks redress for the invasion of privacy, emotional distress, and potential reputational harm caused by the unauthorized dissemination.</skos:definition>
