        <rdfs:label>Board Chair</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Corporate Chair</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Corporate Chair, or Chairman of the Board, is the presiding officer of a company&apos;s board of directors, responsible for leading board meetings and ensuring effective board governance. The Chair facilitates discussions, oversees board functions, and often acts as a liaison between the board and executive management.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Chairman of the Board</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


