        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">未能进行计划付款的驳回申请书</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Dismiss Case for Failure to Make Plan Payments is a legal request made by a party in a bankruptcy case to dismiss the case due to the debtor&apos;s failure to make payments as required by the bankruptcy plan.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


