        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">知的財産権主張</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">知识产权声明</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Intellectual Property Claims refer to legal actions taken by a party to protect their exclusive rights to intangible assets such as patents, trademarks, copyrights, and trade secrets.</skos:definition>
