        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">私的権利侵害</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A private nuisance is a type of legal wrong that occurs when one person&apos;s use of their property interferes with another person&apos;s use and enjoyment of their own property.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


