        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">同意判決</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Consent Judgment is a legal decision made by a court that is agreed upon by both parties involved in a dispute, rather than being imposed by the court itself.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


