        <rdfs:label>04_2 Immigration (PACER NoS)</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Immigration (PACER NoS) refers to the category of legal cases related to immigration matters, as classified by the PACER Nature of Suit (NoS) Codes.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


