        <rdfs:label>Government Employee</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>A government employee is an individual who works for a governmental organization, typically as part of the civil service. Unlike elected or appointed officials, government employees are usually career professionals who perform administrative, technical, or operational tasks to implement government policies and provide public services.</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Class>
    


