        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">申请免除提交费</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Application to Have Filing Fee Waived is a request made by an individual or entity to waive the fee required to file for bankruptcy.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


