        <skos:altLabel>Executive Governance Monitoring</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Governmental Regulation Tracking</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Regulatory Tracking</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Executive Branch Monitoring Practice entails the systematic observation and analysis of actions and decisions made by the executive branch of government, including regulatory agencies and administrative bodies. This practice ensures that executive activities comply with legal standards and provides stakeholders with insights into regulatory changes and administrative actions.</skos:definition>
