        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">针对公众的犯罪</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Crimes Against the Public are offenses that harm or disrupt the general welfare and safety of society, including but not limited to prostitution, disorderly conduct, rioting, weapons offenses, unlawful assembly, criminal gang participation, unlawful gaming and lotteries, curfew violations, loitering, vagrancy, disorderly house, failure to disperse, and drug crimes.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


