        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">普罗旺斯语，古老的；奥克语，古老的</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Old Provençal and Occitan languages, up to the year 1500, used in legal documents, artifacts, evidence, testimony, proceedings, or any other legal aspect.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


