        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">優先購入権条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Right of First Offer Clause is a provision in a contract that gives a party the right to be the first to purchase a property or asset before it is offered to others.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


