        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">アブハズ語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">阿布哈兹语</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Abkhazian (Language) is a structured system of communication that consists of grammar and vocabulary specific to the Abkhazian language, which is used in legal matters.</skos:definition>
