        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">驳回索赔动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Disallow Claims is a legal request made in a bankruptcy case to prevent certain claims from being considered valid or enforceable.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


