        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">提出日</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The &quot;Date Filed&quot; concept refers to the specific date on which a document or artifact was officially submitted or recorded, and is a component of the larger category of &quot;Document Components&quot;.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


