        <rdfs:label>New York Supreme Court - Rensselaer County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>New York Supreme Court - Rensselaer County: A court of general jurisdiction in the state of New York that hears civil and criminal cases within Rensselaer County.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


