        <rdfs:label>Financial Indicators</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Financial Indicators are quantitative measures that provide insights into the financial performance of a business or investment. Examples include balance, which can help in evaluating an entity&apos;s financial health and growth potential.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/ROZmTXLTXjHkl2dG0WM5DT -->

