        <rdfs:label>Furniture and Home Furnishings Retailers</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Furniture and Home Furnishings Store Industry</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Furniture and Home Furnishings Stores</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Industria de tiendas de muebles y artículos para el hogar</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Industria de tiendas de muebles y artículos para el hogar</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Industrie des magasins de meubles et d&apos;ameublement</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Indústria de lojas de móveis e artigos para o lar</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Möbel- und Einrichtungsgeschäftsbranche</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תעשיית חנויות ריהוט וציוד לבית</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">फर्नीचर और होम फर्निशिंग्स स्टोर उद्योग</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">家具および家庭用品店業界</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">家具和家居用品店行业</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in retailing new furniture and home furnishings.  Establishments in this industry group with fixed point-of-sale locations may operate from showrooms and have substantial areas for the presentation of their products.  Establishments in this industry group may provide incidental services, including interior decorating, product assembly, installation, or repair services.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel>FURR</skos:hiddenLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


