        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">発見コストシフト</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Discovery Cost-shifting refers to the allocation of expenses related to the process of obtaining evidence in a legal case, where the burden of paying for the discovery is shifted from one party to another.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


