        <skos:definition>Document Collections by Areas of Law are a type of Transactional Document that group together various legal documents related to specific areas of law, such as Real Estate, Mergers &amp; Acquisitions, and Trusts and Estate Planning.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


