        <skos:altLabel>Correctional Institution</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Prison is a secure facility used to confine individuals who have been convicted of serious crimes and are serving sentences of incarceration. It is designed to ensure public safety, rehabilitate offenders, and deter future criminal behavior, typically operated by government authorities or private entities under government contract.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Long-Term Detention Facility</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel>Penitentiary</skos:prefLabel>
