        <rdfs:label>Delusional Disorder</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Paranoid Disorder</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Delusional Disorder is a mental health condition characterized by the presence of one or more persistent delusions that are not attributable to other mental health disorders or medical conditions. Individuals with delusional disorder experience significant distress or impairment due to the belief in false, fixed, and unshakable convictions despite evidence to the contrary.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Fixed False Belief Disorder</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


