        <rdfs:label>Pancreas Transplantation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Pancreas Graft Surgery</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Pancreas transplantation is a surgical procedure that involves replacing a diseased or non-functional pancreas with a healthy donor pancreas. This transplant is often performed for patients with severe type 1 diabetes who have difficult-to-manage blood sugar levels and complications from the disease.</skos:definition>
