        <rdfs:label>King</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A King is a male monarch who holds the highest royal title and serves as the sovereign ruler of a kingdom or realm. This hereditary or elected position typically involves both ceremonial duties and varying degrees of political power, depending on the constitutional structure of the country.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>His Majesty</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RTM0OWNVhLnesUlYZpd1jF -->

