        <rdfs:label>ADR Court-Annexed Arbitration Forum</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>An ADR Court-Annexed Arbitration Forum is a type of Alternative Dispute Resolution (ADR) Forum that is attached to a court and provides a process for resolving disputes outside of the traditional court system.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


