        <rdfs:label>Regulatory Filing Event</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Regulatory Filing Event refers to a specific action or submission made to comply with regulations or requirements set forth by a governing authority. In the context of immigration, it could involve submitting applications, documents, or forms that adhere to the regulations and procedures established by immigration authorities for various immigration-related matters.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


