        <rdfs:label>Cucumbers</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Cucumis Sativus</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Gherkins</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Cucumbers are elongated, green fruit vegetables from the Cucumis sativus species, known for their crisp texture and refreshing taste. They are commonly consumed raw in salads, pickled, or used as a garnish, and are valued for their hydrating properties and low calorie content.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


