        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">व्यक्ति द्वारा घटना के आदेश देने से भरपाई</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">从下令侵权的人获得赔偿</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">侵害を命じた人からの補償</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Indemnification from Person Ordering Tort: A legal concept that refers to the compensation or protection provided to a party who is held liable for a tortious act, but is entitled to be reimbursed by the person who ordered or directed the act.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


