        <skos:definition>The concept of Threatened Battery Assault refers to a criminal assault where the perpetrator intentionally causes the victim to fear immediate bodily harm or offensive contact, without actually making physical contact.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Threatened Violence</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


