        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">新审判动议-不当陪审团审议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion for New Trial - Improper Jury Deliberations is a legal request made by a party to a case asking the court to set aside the verdict and order a new trial due to improper conduct during jury deliberations.</skos:definition>
