        <rdfs:label>Knowledge Management Services</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Knowledge Management Services refers to professional services that involve the strategic management of an organization&apos;s knowledge resources, including the creation, sharing, and utilization of knowledge assets, and are provided by consultants or managers.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


