        <rdfs:label>Management Committee</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Management Committee typically oversees the daily operations of an organization, managing broader aspects than those typically handled by an executive committee. This committee is often composed of senior managers across different departments and is responsible for implementing the strategic decisions made by the board or executive committee.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


