        <rdfs:label>Trial Preparation Management</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Trial Preparation Management refers to the process of organizing and managing the various tasks and activities involved in preparing for a trial, including gathering evidence, interviewing witnesses, and developing legal strategies.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RYjASJwbdzU2KzBxdoG87y -->

