        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Sublocatário responsável perante o locador pelo aluguel</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Untermieter haftet gegenüber dem Vermieter für die Miete</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">サブテナントは家賃を負担するために家主に対して責任を負います</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">转租人对房东负责租金</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A subtenant who occupies a rental property is responsible for paying rent to the landlord, even if the subtenant has an agreement with the primary tenant to pay rent to them instead.</skos:definition>
