        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">责任条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Liability Clause is a provision in a contract that outlines the responsibility of one party to compensate the other party for any losses or damages incurred as a result of a breach of the contract.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


