        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDr6DXAcukDYZgOiiRN8qtf"/>
        <rdfs:label>Naturalization Clause Claim</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Anspruch auf die Staatsbürgerschaftsklausel</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Naturalization Clause Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Reclamación de la Cláusula de Naturalización</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Reclamación de la Cláusula de Naturalización</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Reivindicação da Cláusula de Naturalização</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Revendication de la clause de naturalisation</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעת סעיף הזרם</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">प्राकृतिकरण धारा दावा</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">帰化条項の主張</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">归化条款要求</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Naturalization Clause claim is a legal assertion related to Article I, Section 8, Clause 4 of the United States Constitution, which grants Congress the power &quot;To establish a uniform Rule of Naturalization.&quot; This clause provides the federal government with the authority to set the rules for becoming a U.S. citizen. A claim involving the Naturalization Clause may arise in situations where there is a dispute over the application or interpretation of federal immigration and naturalization laws.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


