        <rdfs:label>Governmental Policy</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>A Governmental Policy is a deliberate plan of action or inaction chosen by a government to address societal issues, guide decision-making, and achieve specific goals. These policies are formulated through legislative, executive, or administrative processes and cover various sectors, including economic, social, environmental, and foreign affairs.</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Government Strategy</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>State Policy</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel>Public Policy</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


