        <skos:definition>Status Process Outcome reflects the result or disposition of a particular process or action — at a particular point in time — often indicating the decision or outcome of an application, request, or submission within a legal or regulatory context. This status conveys the relevant authority&apos;s determination, such as &quot;approved,&quot; &quot;denied,&quot; &quot;received,&quot; &quot;responded,&quot; or &quot;withdrawn.&quot;</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


