        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">第三者苦情申立</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A third-party complaint is a legal document filed by a defendant against a non-party who may be liable for some or all of the plaintiff&apos;s claims.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


