        <rdfs:label>Surface Water Rights</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>These rights pertain to the use of water from sources that exist on the surface of the land, such as lakes, rivers, and streams. The allocation and usage of these rights can be based on factors like historic use, regional laws, and treaties.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


