        <rdfs:label>PA130 Document/File Management</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A narrowly defined task that includes creating and populating document and other databases or filing systems, that does not fit under other task codes below. Includes the planning, design, and overall management of this process. Work of outside vendors in building litigation support databases should be an expense under E100. Calendaring (or &quot;docketing&quot; in the U.S.) should be included under the appropriate task codes below for each matter unless, otherwise instructed by the client.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>PA130 Document/File Management</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


