        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">美国司法援助局</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The U.S. Bureau of Justice Assistance (BJA) is a specific governmental organization within the Office of Justice Programs that provides funding, training, and technical assistance to support law enforcement, courts, and other justice-related agencies.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


