        <rdfs:label>Visa for Specialized Knowledge Worker</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>L-1B Visa</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>This visa (in the U.S.,  L-1B visa) is designed for foreign workers with specialized knowledge related to the field, products, or processes of their destination-country-based employer (e.g., U.S.-based employer). In the United States, this non-immigrant visa allows these specialized knowledge employees to be transferred from a foreign office to a U.S. office within the same company for up to five years.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


