        <skos:definition>A wage is a payment or income earned by an individual in exchange for their labor or services, typically provided on an hourly, daily, weekly, or monthly basis. It represents the compensation received for work performed and is often subject to taxes and deductions.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


