        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">拟议法院文件</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">提案された裁判所提出書類</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Proposed Court Filings are documents submitted to a court for consideration, which include proposed instructions, conclusions of law, orders, and findings of fact, and are part of the trial court practice documents.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


