        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">家主補償条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">房东赔偿条款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Landlord Indemnification Clause is a specific type of contractual clause that requires the tenant to compensate the landlord for any losses or damages incurred as a result of the tenant&apos;s actions or negligence.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


