            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Fishing Rights</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>These rights provide the holder with the privilege to catch fish in specific bodies of water. This can be governed by licenses, permits, or treaties, especially in areas with shared water resources.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


