        <rdfs:label>Manager</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Manager is an individual in an organization who has the responsibility of overseeing a team or a set of processes, making decisions, and ensuring that tasks and goals are successfully completed. Managers often have authority to make personnel decisions, allocate resources, and are accountable for the performance and outcomes of their team or department.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


