        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">显示器</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Under Canadian Companies&apos; Creditors Arrangement Act (CCAA), a Monitor is an independent third party who is appointed by the Court to monitor the company&apos;s ongoing operations and assist with the filing and voting on the Plan of Arrangement.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hiddenLabel>MNTR</skos:hiddenLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


