        <rdfs:label>Securities Commission Letter</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Securities Commission Letter is an official communication issued by a securities regulatory agency. The letter typically provides guidance, regulations, or enforcement actions related to the issuance and trading of securities in the financial market.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Financial Market Authority Correspondence</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


