        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RHZTIZfN6Fbrf6azRExLaD"/>
        <rdfs:label>Publicity Covenant</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A &quot;Publicity Covenant&quot; is a contractual provision in which the parties agree on how information related to the transaction or relationship will be disclosed to the public or third parties. This can include stipulations on press releases, announcements, or other public communications, ensuring that both parties have control over or give consent to how the information is presented and disseminated.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rog9UspQXGdvkr0jXCaH9F -->

