        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">关于证据、记录或附录的动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">証拠、記録、または付録に関する動議</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion on Evidence, the Record, or Appendix is a formal request made to an appellate court to take certain actions related to the evidence, record, or appendix in a legal case, such as correcting errors or supplementing the record.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


