        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">建设性欺诈转移</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Constructive Fraudulent Transfer refers to a transfer of property made with the intent to defraud creditors or hinder their ability to collect debts, but without actual fraudulent intent.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


