        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">軍事的差別待遇</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Military Discrimination refers to claims of unfair treatment or prejudice based on an individual&apos;s past or present military service or affiliation.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


