        <skos:altLabel>Intelligent Autonomous System</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Self-Governing AI System</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Autonomous AI System is an artificial intelligence system capable of performing tasks with minimal human intervention, relying on its ability to analyze data and make decisions independently. These systems are designed to learn and adapt to new situations without explicit programming, enabling them to function in dynamic environments</skos:definition>
