        <rdfs:label>Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court - Cumberland County</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court in Cumberland County is a specific court within the Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court system that handles minor criminal offenses, traffic violations, and civil cases involving amounts up to $12,000.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RsNCuDHhcBOYuucDj6oqxT -->

