        <skos:altLabel>Bachelor of Arts</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The suffix &quot;B.A.&quot; stands for &quot;Bachelor of Arts&quot; and is used after a person&apos;s name to indicate that they have earned an undergraduate degree in a field typically related to the humanities, social sciences, or fine arts. This designation signifies the individual&apos;s foundational knowledge and skills in their chosen field of study and is commonly used in academic, professional, and formal settings</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>B.A.</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


