        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">发票净总额应付款</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">請求書合計純額支払い</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The &quot;Invoice Total Net Due&quot; is a specific type of fee invoice detail that represents the total amount owed by the client after all deductions and adjustments have been made.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RskHhsuhWsZ8Bjxgt5n7yD -->

