        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">賃貸契約または執行契約の拒否申立</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">驳回租赁或执行合同动议</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Motion to Reject Lease or Executory Contract is a request made in a bankruptcy case to terminate a lease or contract that is burdensome to the debtor&apos;s estate.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


