        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Reclamación de Cláusula de Poder Reservado</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Reivindicação de cláusula de poder reservado</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Reserved Power Clause Claim</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Revendication de clause de pouvoir réservé</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעת סעיף כוח מורשה מראש</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">रिजर्व्ड पावर क्लॉज क्लेम</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">保留权条款索赔</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">留保権条項クレーム</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Reserved Power Clause claim is a legal assertion related to the Tenth Amendment of the United States Constitution, which reserves to the states or the people any powers not specifically delegated to the federal government or prohibited to the states by the Constitution. This clause forms the basis of federalism, the division of power between the federal government and the states. A claim involving this clause typically arises when there is a dispute over whether a power exercised by the federal government infringes on powers reserved to the states or the people.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rtk1I9my9XunVh1G3oh8ML -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rtk1I9my9XunVh1G3oh8ML">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R88D8i8AcSTUig2X3yPbFHg"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Q31MHgiF9qpQ2nPT5UPWp"/>
        <rdfs:label>Revenue Share Agreement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Rev Share Agreement</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Revenue Share Agreement is a contractual arrangement where the parties agree to share a portion of the generated revenue from a specific project, product, or business venture. This type of agreement is often used in collaborative business models, joint ventures, or licensing deals to align the interests of the parties and distribute earnings based on their respective contributions or agreed-upon terms.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Profit Sharing Agreement</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rtk9_RnfyT9yacC_QKTzn8Q -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rtk9_RnfyT9yacC_QKTzn8Q">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RqzUQwYBbTQOr5rDpNMHCZQ"/>
        <rdfs:label>WC300 Discovery / Document Production</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rtlb0g8ixWZV3HQygRlqzy -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rtlb0g8ixWZV3HQygRlqzy">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R85Datx36zz4sBBoEYxCByw"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R787C07azf3BxNqxCxSvBxc"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>County Governmental Representative</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>District Representative</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Sub-National Territory Representative</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A County Governmental Representative is an elected or appointed official who serves in a governmental body overseeing an area larger than a municipality but smaller than a state or province. This individual is responsible for policy-making, budget allocation, and administration of services for a specific region, such as a county, district, or prefecture.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>County Official</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RtmRdqzdG4lddVrtCToiL1 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RtmRdqzdG4lddVrtCToiL1">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8GyyJdxlZtc7PsW9vLAKfE"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9b5fs8QJuliSZYeaJLJU2t"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDYMSvTzMQvR5oJWYzguyJW"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Breach of Fiduciary Duty</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Breach of Fiduciary Duty</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Incumplimiento del deber fiduciario</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Incumplimiento del deber fiduciario</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Verletzung der Treuepflicht</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Violation du devoir de fidélité</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Violação do dever fiduciário</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הפרת חובת נאמנות</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">विश्वासदाता कर्तव्य का उल्लंघन</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">信託義務違反</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">违反信托责任</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Breach of Fiduciary Duty refers to a situation where a person in a position of trust and confidence, such as a trustee, agent, or business partner, fails to act in the best interests of the other party and instead acts in their own self-interest, resulting in harm or loss to the other party.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RtoqwGhjnspOeVmvIXfmF0 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RtoqwGhjnspOeVmvIXfmF0">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDu2iPpQAdciNSirAd52mw4"/>
        <dc:source rdf:resource="https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/9.00-Endocrine-Adult.htm"/>
        <rdfs:label>Parathyroid Gland Disorders</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Parathyroid gland disorders affect the regulation of calcium levels in the body, influencing bone health, blood calcium levels, and nerve and muscle function. These disorders can lead to osteoporosis, fractures, hypercalcemia, kidney failure, and hypocalcemia with associated symptoms such as tetany and muscle spasms.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Parathyroid Dysfunction</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RtowQ7kj1Qwrif8iyWxem7 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RtowQ7kj1Qwrif8iyWxem7">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RgBq3kUkMfNYtUi93XIh0i"/>
        <rdfs:label>Material Adverse Effect Definition - &quot;Relating to&quot; Language</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Definición de Efecto Adverso Material - Lenguaje &quot;Relativo a&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Definición de Efecto Adverso Material - Lenguaje &quot;Relativo a&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Definition des wesentlichen nachteiligen Effekts - Sprache, die sich auf etwas bezieht</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Definição de Efeito Adverso Material - Linguagem Relativa a Algo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Définition de l&apos;effet indésirable important - Langue relative à quelque chose</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>MAE</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Material Adverse Effect Definition - &quot;Relating to&quot; Language</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הגדרת השפעה נזיקה חומרית - שפה &quot;קשורה ל&quot;</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">सामग्री विपरीत प्रभाव परिभाषा - &quot;संबंधित&quot; भाषा</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">实质不利影响定义 - 与某事相关的语言</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">重大な不利な影響の定義-何かに関連する言語</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Material Adverse Effect (MAE) Definition - &quot;Relating to&quot; Language refers to a clause in a contract that outlines the specific circumstances under which a party can terminate the agreement if there is a significant negative change in the other party&apos;s financial or business condition that affects the overall value of the contract.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


