        <rdfs:label>Risk Management</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The concept of Risk Management refers to the process of identifying, assessing, and prioritizing potential risks that may affect a business or organization, and implementing strategies to mitigate or avoid those risks.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RuBd7UIXBNWTIC6Dr67bz7 -->

