        <rdfs:label>Injury</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>An injury refers to damage or harm caused to the structure or function of the body, either due to external forces or internal causes. Injuries can be physical or emotional and can result from accidents, falls, hits, weapons, and other causes, leading to pain, discomfort, or disability.</skos:definition>
