        <skos:definition>A claim for falling on grease is a legal assertion made by a plaintiff who has suffered injury due to slipping on a surface contaminated with grease, and is a subcategory of the broader concept of slip-and-fall negligence.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


