        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">附件</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Attachment refers to a legal remedy that allows a creditor to seize a debtor&apos;s property before a judgment is made, in order to secure payment of a debt.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


