        <skos:altLabel>Job Training</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Vocational Training</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>&quot;Employment Training&quot; refers to the process of acquiring or enhancing the skills, knowledge, and competencies necessary for a specific job or career. It often involves formal or informal education, on-the-job training, workshops, or courses designed to prepare individuals for employment or improve their performance in a current job.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Workforce Development</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


