        <skos:definition>These rights concern the ownership and extraction of metallic minerals, like gold, silver, copper, and iron, from a particular area of land. These rights can be leased, sold, or transferred, allowing either the owner or the lessee to profit from the extraction of these minerals.</skos:definition>
