        <rdfs:label>Income Tax Payment</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>Taxes on income, profits and capital gains</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>An Income Tax Payment Event refers to the specific instance when an individual or entity makes a payment to satisfy their income tax obligations. This includes periodic payments such as quarterly estimated tax payments or annual tax settlements, made to the relevant tax authorities.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel>Income Tax Remittance</skos:prefLabel>
