        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">支配権変更条項</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Change in Control Clause is a provision in a contract that outlines the conditions under which a change in ownership or control of a company would trigger certain rights or obligations for the parties involved.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rx7CkM9fjahTS5lZtG21ZR -->

