        <rdfs:label>DEPRECATED: Litigation Deliverables</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Deprecated: Litigation Deliverables refers to the specific documents or items that are produced or provided as part of a litigation engagement, which are no longer in use or recommended.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


