        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Lei de Private Equity, Hedge Funds e Venture Capital</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Ley de Capital Privado, Fondos de Cobertura y Capital de Riesgo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Ley de Capital Privado, Fondos de Cobertura y Capital de Riesgo</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Private Equity, Hedge Funds and Venture Capital Law</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">חוק הון פרטי, קרנות השתלמות והון סיכון</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">प्राइवेट इक्विटी, हेज फंड और वेंचर कैपिटल कानून</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">プライベートエクイティ、ヘッジファンド、ベンチャーキャピタル法</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">私募股权、对冲基金和风险投资法律</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Private Equity, Hedge Funds, and Venture Capital Law encompasses the legal frameworks governing private equity investments, hedge funds, and venture capital financing. It involves regulations related to fund formation, management, investment, compliance, investor rights, and financial transactions within these sectors.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


