        <rdfs:label>PA499 Other Patent Prosecution - Domestic</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Use only for patent prosecution activities for applications that are to be initially filed in the (&apos;domestic&apos;) home country or region of the applicant, and that can not be included under a previous code, or as instructed by the client.</skos:definition>
