        <rdfs:label>Port of Entry</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>POE</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>&quot;Port of Entry&quot; (POE) is the official location where an individual enters a country, subject to immigration inspection and clearance by authorities, determining their eligibility to enter and stay within the country&apos;s borders.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


