        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">फैसले या आदेश के अंदरूनी लागूता को रोकना</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">फैसले या आदेश के अंदरूनी विधिक कार्य को रोकना</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">判決または命令の執行停止</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">暂缓执行判决或命令</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A Stay Execution of Judgment or Order is a legal concept that refers to a request made by a party to temporarily suspend the enforcement of a court&apos;s decision or order, typically while an appeal or other legal action is pending.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


