        <rdfs:label>Other General Purpose Machinery Manufacturing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing pumps and compressors, material handling equipment, and all other general purpose machinery (except ventilation, heating, air-conditioning, and commercial refrigeration equipment; metalworking machinery; and engines, turbines, and power transmission equipment).</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/S12-VZg9R06JW6Mqb9pUYg -->

