        <rdfs:label>Taxi and Ridesharing Services</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in providing passenger transportation by automobile or van, not operated over regular routes and on regular schedules. Establishments of taxicab owner/operators, taxicab fleet operators, taxicab organizations, ridesharing services (including arrangement services), and ride hailing services (including arrangement services) are included in this industry.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


