        <rdfs:label>Support Activities for Road Transportation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) towing light or heavy motor vehicles, both local and long-distance, or (2) providing other services to road network users.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/_TrONq-CTSy2Q5b9du0awA -->

