        <rdfs:label>Dual-Purpose Cattle Ranching and Farming</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in raising cattle for both milking and meat production.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/enRP4jnPSoK2T97JxxW_dw -->

