        <rdfs:label>Chemical and Allied Products Merchant Wholesalers</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in the merchant wholesale distribution of chemicals, plastics materials and basic forms and shapes, and allied products.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


