        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=11411"/>
        <rdfs:label>Fishing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in the commercial catching or taking of finfish, shellfish, or miscellaneous marine products from a natural habitat, such as the catching of bluefish, eels, salmon, tuna, clams, crabs, lobsters, mussels, oysters, shrimp, frogs, sea urchins, and turtles.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/ff3wBuxvQzeuncm8qh2z3A -->

