        <rdfs:label>Ornamental and Architectural Metal Products Manufacturing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing one or more of the following: (1) metal framed windows (i.e., typically using purchased glass) and metal doors; (2) sheet metal work; and (3) ornamental and architectural metal products.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


