        <skos:definition>This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in producing and distributing musical recordings, publishing music, or providing sound recording and related services.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/i1atZEweTcKbLwnLHAcDyw -->

