        <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing glass and/or glass products.  Establishments in this industry may manufacture glass and/or glass products by melting silica sand or cullet, or from purchased glass.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/iKyrN2E8SVy47edI3SNUlQ -->

