        <rdfs:label>Softwood Veneer and Plywood Manufacturing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing softwood veneer and/or softwood plywood.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


