        <rdfs:label>Fire Protection</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry comprises government establishments primarily engaged in firefighting and other related fire protection activities. Government establishments providing combined fire protection and ambulance or rescue services are classified in this industry.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


