        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=336213"/>
        <rdfs:label>Motor Home Manufacturing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) manufacturing motor homes on purchased chassis and/or (2) manufacturing conversion vans on an assembly line basis. Motor homes are units where the motor and the living quarters are integrated in the same unit.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


