        <rdfs:label>Transportation Equipment and Supplies (except Motor Vehicle) Merchant Wholesalers</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in the merchant wholesale distribution of transportation equipment and supplies (except marine pleasure craft and motor vehicles).</skos:definition>
