        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=322130"/>
        <rdfs:label>Paperboard Mills</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing paperboard (e.g., can/drum stock, container board, corrugating medium, folding carton stock, linerboard, tube) from pulp. These establishments may manufacture or purchase pulp. In addition, the establishments may also convert the paperboard they make.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


