        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=324122"/>
        <rdfs:label>Asphalt Shingle and Coating Materials Manufacturing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) saturating purchased mats and felts with asphalt or tar from purchased asphaltic materials and (2) manufacturing asphalt and tar and roofing cements and coatings from purchased asphaltic materials.</skos:definition>
