        <rdfs:label>Appliance Repair and Maintenance</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in repairing and servicing household appliances without retailing new appliances, such as refrigerators, stoves, washing machines, clothes dryers, and room air-conditioners.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


