        <rdfs:label>Nonferrous Metal (except Aluminum) Production and Processing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in nonferrous metal (except aluminum) smelting, refining, rolling, drawing, extruding, and alloying.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


