        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=311612"/>
        <rdfs:label>Meat Processed from Carcasses</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in processing or preserving meat and meat byproducts (except poultry and small game) from purchased meats. This industry includes establishments primarily engaged in assembly cutting and packing of meats (i.e., boxed meats) from purchased meats.</skos:definition>
